ERO1, RevPro and OTT. He has been voted Veteran Wrestler Of The Year two times.","alterEgos":["Black Tiger VI"],"birthplace":"Kawasaki, Kanagawa, Japan","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-349","wrestlerId":349,"promotionId":38,"startDate":"2006-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":80000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3036,3045,4241],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":80,"storytelling":82,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":23,"matchLayout":82,"psychology":80,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":80,"technicalCoaching":47,"characterCoaching":55,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":77,"mediaHandling":55,"brandBuilding":50,"socialMediaSavvy":45,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":80,"consistency":85,"awareness":80,"judgement":88},"picture":"Tomohiro Ishii.png","injury":{"type":"Major Food Poisoning","daysToRecover":-3},"returnDate":"2026-04-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":350,"name":"Rocky Romero","realName":"Rocky Romero","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":76,"base":"Other","gender":"M","weight":176,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1982-10-28T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1997-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":40000,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":28,"charisma":68,"micSkills":87,"condition":72,"hardcoreAbility":79,"injuryProne":100,"ability":64,"currentAbility":64,"potentialAbility":66,"morale":"poor","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Rocky Romero is a Cuban wrestler who works in America, Canada, Mexico and Japan. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Technician Striker style. He is best known for his work with NJPW, AEW, CMLL, AAA, IMPACT, NOAH, PWG, wXw, NJoA, ROH, MLW, DEFY, EVOLVE and CWFH. He is currently the NWA World Historic Welterweight champion. He is the current booker of NJoA. He is the protege of Negro Casas. Outside of wrestling he is a former MMA fighter.","alterEgos":["Black Tiger IV","Grey Shadow"],"birthplace":"Havana, Cuba","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-350","wrestlerId":350,"promotionId":76,"startDate":"2021-11-10T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":40000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[981,1054,1055,1258,1301,1302,2045,2657,3025,3026,3278,3279,3417,4079,4204],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":78,"storytelling":81,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":19,"matchLayout":82,"psychology":78,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":84,"technicalCoaching":73,"characterCoaching":73,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":81,"mediaHandling":73,"brandBuilding":53,"socialMediaSavvy":54,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":84,"consistency":76,"awareness":78,"judgement":87},"picture":"Rocky Romero.png","additionalContracts":[{"id":"tew-contract-350-11","wrestlerId":350,"promotionId":11,"startDate":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":32000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},{"id":"tew-contract-350-38","wrestlerId":350,"promotionId":38,"startDate":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":40000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false}],"alsoWorksFor":["CMLL","NJPW"]},{"id":351,"name":"Alex Koslov","realName":"Alex Koslov","nickname":"","type":"commentator","base":"Europe","gender":"M","weight":190,"height":172,"dateOfBirth":"1984-01-21T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2003-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":66000,"popularity":8,"charisma":28,"micSkills":26,"condition":76,"hardcoreAbility":51,"injuryProne":100,"ability":34,"currentAbility":29,"potentialAbility":29,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Alex Koslov is a retired Moldovan wrestler who works primarily as a colour commentator. He is best known for his work with NJoA.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Unknown","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1054,1055],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":62,"storytelling":66,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":17,"matchLayout":68,"psychology":62,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":81,"technicalCoaching":64,"characterCoaching":61,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":83,"mediaHandling":61,"brandBuilding":52,"socialMediaSavvy":44,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":81,"consistency":79,"awareness":62,"judgement":77},"picture":"Alex Koslov_alt1.png"},{"id":352,"name":"Finn Bálor","realName":"Prince Devitt","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":64,"base":"UK","gender":"M","weight":191,"height":177,"dateOfBirth":"1981-07-25T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2001-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":75000,"wageType":"monthly","popularity":60,"charisma":87,"micSkills":70,"condition":80,"hardcoreAbility":78,"injuryProne":100,"ability":71,"currentAbility":71,"potentialAbility":83,"morale":"good","presentation":"face","prestige":"mid","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"The WWE Universe may know Bálor for being the first-ever Universal Champion, but the mysterious Irishman’s legend spanned across countries and continents long before he ever stepped onto the WWE stage. After competing in his first match at 18 and achieving success in his homeland, Bálor relocated to Japan to hone his skills in the notorious dojo system of the Far East. Unsurprisingly, he thrived, winning multiple championships and leading several foot soldiers to support him. He soon relocated to America to ply his trade in NXT, where he achieved a record-setting run with the NXT Championship, among other accolades.\r\n\r\nThe combination of his quiet, accurate precision and his periodic transformation into the terrifying \"Demon\" made Bálor one of the hottest WWE commodities in more than a decade, so it came as little surprise when he was the first NXT graduate to be taken in the 2016 WWE Brand Extension Draft, going fifth overall to Raw.","alterEgos":["Prince Devitt","Pegasus Kid II"],"birthplace":"Bray, County Wicklow, Ireland","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-352","wrestlerId":352,"promotionId":64,"startDate":"2014-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":75000,"wageType":"monthly","type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[934,2774,4072],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":76,"storytelling":79,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":16,"matchLayout":80,"psychology":76,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":88,"technicalCoaching":78,"characterCoaching":75,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":84,"mediaHandling":75,"brandBuilding":73,"socialMediaSavvy":58,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":88,"consistency":81,"awareness":76,"judgement":86},"picture":"Finn Bálor.png"},{"id":353,"name":"Don Fale","realName":"Bad Luck Fale","nickn