t active in the ring, she is seen in his corner as a manager. In October of 2011, Seleziya defeated Courtney Rush to become the new Magnificent Championship Wrestling Women's Champion. Seleziya has suffered a number of injuries in her career, including a broken clavicle which required the insertion of a metal plate.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Canada","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1098],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":52,"storytelling":55,"productFit":48,"riskTaking":29,"matchLayout":56,"psychology":52,"workerManagement":48,"trainingIntensity":63,"technicalCoaching":47,"characterCoaching":60,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":71,"mediaHandling":60,"brandBuilding":74,"socialMediaSavvy":46,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":10,"reactionSpeed":63,"consistency":56,"awareness":52,"judgement":50},"picture":"Seleziya Sparx.png"},{"id":636,"name":"Scarlett Bordeaux","realName":"Scarlett Bordeaux","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":68,"base":"USA","gender":"F","weight":125,"height":167,"dateOfBirth":"1991-05-13T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2011-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":26200,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":36,"charisma":55,"micSkills":61,"condition":97,"hardcoreAbility":60,"injuryProne":100,"ability":41,"currentAbility":40,"potentialAbility":46,"morale":"fair","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"powerhouse","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Scarlett Bordeaux is an American wrestler who works in the USA, Canada, Mexico and Japan. She is a 5'7\", 125lb worker who is classed as using a Entertainer style. She uses the Back-to-Belly Piledriver and the Diving Crossbody as her finishers. She is best known for her work with WWE, TNA, AAA, NXT, ROH and MLW. She is married to Killer Kross.","alterEgos":["Scarlett"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2027-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-636","wrestlerId":636,"promotionId":68,"startDate":"2025-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":26200,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1098],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":51,"storytelling":52,"productFit":25,"riskTaking":34,"matchLayout":52,"psychology":51,"workerManagement":25,"trainingIntensity":68,"technicalCoaching":34,"characterCoaching":70,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":66,"mediaHandling":70,"brandBuilding":79,"socialMediaSavvy":64,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":5,"reactionSpeed":68,"consistency":60,"awareness":51,"judgement":41},"picture":"Scarlett Bordeaux_alt8.png"},{"id":637,"name":"MsChif","realName":"MsChif","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"F","weight":134,"height":167,"dateOfBirth":"1980-06-06T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2001-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":3,"charisma":78,"micSkills":79,"condition":73,"hardcoreAbility":62,"injuryProne":100,"ability":69,"currentAbility":55,"potentialAbility":55,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Rachel Donaldson is an American professional wrestler who is better known by her ring name MsChif. She has been wrestling since 2001 and in that time has worked for several independent promotions across the United States, with guest matches in England and Japan. Among the various championships she has held during her career, she currently holds two with the National Wrestling Alliance (NWA Midwest Women's Championship and NWA World Women's Championship) alongside the Shimmer Championship and has won the ChickFight tournament once. She is known for her banshee gimmick, howling at her opponents and referees who stand in her way, as well as her unusually flexible body that allows her to perform, and be subjected to, modified submission holds.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1240],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":71,"storytelling":72,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":25,"matchLayout":72,"psychology":71,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":82,"technicalCoaching":63,"characterCoaching":71,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":75,"mediaHandling":71,"brandBuilding":56,"socialMediaSavvy":56,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":82,"consistency":77,"awareness":71,"judgement":83},"picture":"MsChif.png"},{"id":638,"name":"Matt Jackson","realName":"Matt Jackson","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":76,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":172,"height":175,"dateOfBirth":"1985-03-13T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2004-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":80000,"wageType":"monthly","popularity":51,"charisma":100,"micSkills":84,"condition":84,"hardcoreAbility":89,"injuryProne":100,"ability":90,"currentAbility":90,"potentialAbility":93,"morale":"good","presentation":"face","prestige":"mid","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Whenever Matt Jackson and his brother Nick -- collectively known as The Young Bucks -- are on the card, fans can expect excitement, a packed house and an official Superkick Party. There isn’t a tag team in pro wrestling more innovative, high-flying or successful than The Young Bucks, who are multi-time tag team champions in both Ring of Honor and New Japan Pro-Wrestling. They’re also members of Bullet Club, the hottest faction in the industry.\r\n\r\nTheir thrilling rivalry with the Hardys in 2017 concluded with The Young Bucks winning an unforgettable ladder match at Supercard of Honor XI in a passing-of-the-torch moment. In addition to their accomplishments inside the ring, Matt and Nick Jackson have built a merchandising empire and are two of the stars of the popular “Being The Elite” YouTube series.","alterEgos":["Max Buck"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-638","wrestlerId":638,"promotionId":76,"startDate":"2019-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":80000,"wageType":"monthly","type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[209,1073,1528,1529,1530,1850,1896],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":75,"storytelling":77,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":21,"matchLayout":78,"psychology":75,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":85,"technicalCoaching":66,"characterCoaching":82,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":79,"mediaHandling":82,"brandBuilding":63,"socialMediaSavvy":72,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":85,"consistency":87,"awareness":75,"judgement":85},"picture":"Matthew Jackson.png"},{"id":639,"name":"Nick Jackson","realName":"Nick Jackson","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":76,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":178,"height":175,"dateOfBirth":"1989-07-28T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2004-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":80000,"wageType":"monthly","popularity":51,"charisma":75,"micSkills":71,"condition":86,"hardcoreAbility":83,"injuryProne":100,"ability":82,"currentAbility":82,"potentialAbility":87,"morale":"good","presentation":"face","prestige":"mid","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBo