ame":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":49,"base":"Australia","gender":"F","weight":132,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1989-06-23T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2007-06-23T00:00:00.000Z","wage":32800,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":31,"charisma":49,"micSkills":26,"condition":91,"hardcoreAbility":43,"injuryProne":100,"ability":31,"currentAbility":29,"potentialAbility":34,"morale":"poor","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"powerhouse","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":true,"story":"Jessie McKay, who graduated from Pro Wrestling Academy on 01 June 2007, is an Australian wrestler who works in the USA, Canada, Japan and Oceania. She is a 5'8\", 132lb worker who is classed as using a Entertainer style. She uses the Boyfriend Stealer and the School Girl Crush as her finishers. She is one half of The IInspiration alongside Cassie Lee. She is best known for her work with WWE, AEW, TNA, NXT, ROH, PWA, SHIMMER, AAW, WR, CHIKARA and CZW. She is married to someone outside the wrestling business. She is the protege of Madison Eagles.","alterEgos":["Billie Kay"],"birthplace":"Sydney, New South Wales, Australia","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-663","wrestlerId":663,"promotionId":49,"startDate":"2026-02-15T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":32800,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1276,1742,2435,2436,3069,4140,4347],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":44,"storytelling":45,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":34,"matchLayout":45,"psychology":44,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":58,"technicalCoaching":33,"characterCoaching":80,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":66,"mediaHandling":80,"brandBuilding":62,"socialMediaSavvy":77,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":58,"consistency":47,"awareness":44,"judgement":66},"picture":"Billie Kay.png"},{"id":666,"name":"Nicole Matthews","realName":"Nicole Matthews","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Canada","gender":"F","weight":190,"height":172,"dateOfBirth":"1987-01-15T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2006-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":4166,"popularity":7,"charisma":56,"micSkills":59,"condition":89,"hardcoreAbility":73,"injuryProne":100,"ability":72,"currentAbility":65,"potentialAbility":69,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Nicole Matthews is a Canadian professional wrestler who regularly wrestles for Shimmer Women Athletes and NWA: Extreme Canadian Championship Wrestling. She currently teams with fellow Canadian wrestler Portia Perez as the Canadian Ninjas. Matthews was originally convinced to try a career in professional wrestling by her friend, male wrestler Sid Sylum. She made her professional wrestling debut in February 2006 alongside fellow trainee Veronika Vice. Matthews sent a demo tape to Shimmer Women Athletes in December 2006, but was not signed to the promotion. In October 2007, however, Matthews was called to join the company when Portia Perez needed a tag team partner.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Canada","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[979],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":75,"storytelling":77,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":14,"matchLayout":77,"psychology":75,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":78,"technicalCoaching":65,"characterCoaching":78,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":86,"mediaHandling":78,"brandBuilding":44,"socialMediaSavvy":67,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":78,"consistency":86,"awareness":75,"judgement":85},"picture":"Nicole Matthews.png"},{"id":667,"name":"Portia Perez","realName":"Portia Perez","nickname":"","type":"trainer","base":"Canada","gender":"F","weight":121,"height":154,"dateOfBirth":"1987-10-26T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2004-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":66000,"popularity":6,"charisma":66,"micSkills":44,"condition":79,"hardcoreAbility":60,"injuryProne":100,"ability":62,"currentAbility":56,"potentialAbility":56,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Jenna Grattan is a Canadian professional wrestler best known under the stage name Portia Perez. Perez made her professional debut in summer 2004 for Professional Wrestling Entertainment. While still in high school, Portia took bookings with many companies in Quebec and Ontario, including the promotion she trained with: Universal Wrestling Alliance. In January 2006, Portia took part in her first international tour, spending four weeks in Ireland's Irish Whip Wrestling and England's All Star Wrestling. After returning to Canada, she continued to perform in many Canadian and American companies, including debuting for Shimmer Women Athletes in May 2006. Perez made her Mexican wrestling debut in June 2006 as a masked competitor named Xtasis. She spent three weeks competing for Lucha Libre Feminil as well as appearing for Asistencia Asesoría y Administración (AAA).","alterEgos":["Xtasis"],"birthplace":"Canada","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[979],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":58,"storytelling":60,"productFit":30,"riskTaking":28,"matchLayout":57,"psychology":50,"workerManagement":48,"trainingIntensity":47,"technicalCoaching":53,"characterCoaching":53,"teaching":86,"diagnosis":53,"rehabilitation":29,"prevention":39,"mediaHandling":30,"brandBuilding":54,"socialMediaSavvy":28,"ruleKnowledge":55,"positioning":35,"reactionSpeed":42,"consistency":50,"awareness":21,"judgement":52},"picture":"Portia Perez_alt2.png"},{"id":668,"name":"Christina Von Eerie","realName":"Christina Von Eerie","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"F","weight":123,"height":160,"dateOfBirth":"1989-08-28T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":5,"charisma":53,"micSkills":44,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":50,"injuryProne":100,"ability":58,"currentAbility":55,"potentialAbility":60,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Christina Maria Kardooni is an American professional wrestler, better known by her ring name Christina Von Eerie. She is known for working for Asistencia Asesoría y Administración (AAA), Pro Wrestling Guerrilla (PWG) and Total Nonstop Action Wrestling (TNA), where she performed under the ring name Toxxin. In AAA, she held the AAA World Mixed Tag Team Championship with Alex Koslov. After receiving her training at the Supreme Pro Wrestling Training Academy in her hometown of Sacramento, Von Eerie made her professional wrestling debut in 2006 and started working for various professional wrestling promotions on the West Coast. On March 27, 2010, Von Eerie made a one–time appearance for Dragon Gate USA, accompanying Jon Moxley to the ring. On March 2, 2011, Chicago, Illinois–based all–female promotion Shimmer Women Athletes announced that Von Eerie would make her debut for the promotion at the March 26 and 27 tapings.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1240],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":52,"storytelling":55,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":56,"psychology":52,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":76,"technicalCoaching":51,"characterCoaching":65,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":63,"mediaHandling":65,"brandBuilding":48,"socialMediaSavvy":56,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":76,"consistency":63,"awareness":52,"judgement":71},"picture":"Christina Von Eerie.png"},{"id":669,"name":"Leva Bates","realName":"Leva Bates","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"F","weight":114,"height":154,"dateOfBirth":"1983-05-21T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2006-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":9,"charisma":62,"micSkills":65,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":37,"injuryProne":100,"ability":58,"currentAbility":49,"potentialAbility":52,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Leva Bates is an American wrestler who works in America and Canada. She is a Small worker who is classed as using a Regular style. She is best known for her work with AEW. She is married to someone outside the wrestling business.","alterEgos":["Blue Pants"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1209,1290,1643,2729],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":54,"storytelling":56,"productFit":73,"riskTaking":36,"matchLayout":57,"psychology":54,"workerManagement":73,"trainingIntensity":69,"technicalCoaching":48,"characterCoaching":68,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":64,"mediaHandling":68,"brandBuilding":32,"socialMediaSavvy":68,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":15,"reactionSpeed":69,"consistency":74,"awareness":54,"judgement":62},"picture":"Leva Bates_alt2.png"},{"id":670,"name":"LuFisto","realName":"LuFisto","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Canada","gender":"F","weight":170,"height":154,"dateOfBirth":"1980-02-15T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1997-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":10,"charisma":75,"micSkills":70,"condition":76,"hardcoreAbility":59,"injuryProne":100,"ability":74,"currentAbility":58,"potentialAbility":58,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"submission","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Geneviève (Genny) Goulet is a French Canadian professional wrestler who works under the ringname LuFisto. Goulet began training when she was 17 years old in Sorel, Quebec, Canada, her hometown. On June 23, 1997, she made her wrestling debut in St-Leonard-d'Aston, Quebec, under the ring name Lucifer. In late 1998, she joined the Eastern Wrestling Alliance under the name \"Luscious Lucy\" as \"Centerfold\" Steve Ramsey's valet. She also began appearing at Green Mountain Wrestling shows in Vermont at this point.  She debuted in Shimmer Women Athletes on October 24, 2006 in Berwyn, Illinois. In early June 2009 the birth of a new all Female Canadian promotion, nCw Femmes Fatales, administered by LuFisto and Stephane Bruyere, the former booker of ALF, was announced. On February 21, 2013, Asistencia Asesoría y Administración (AAA) announced that LuFisto had signed with the promotion.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Canada","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1128,2670,2915],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":75,"storytelling":77,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":35,"matchLayout":78,"psychology":75,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":74,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":73,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":65,"mediaHandling":73,"brandBuilding":61,"socialMediaSavvy":56,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":74,"consistency":75,"awareness":75,"judgement":85},"picture":"LuFisto_alt7.png"},{"id":671,"name":"Melanie Cruise","realName":"Melanie Cruise","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"F","weight":161,"height":180,"dateOfBirth":"1987-01-07T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":7,"charisma":45,"micSkills":63,"condition":76,"hardcoreAbility":43,"injuryProne":81,"ability":45,"currentAbility":41,"potentialAbility":41,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"powerhouse","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Melanie Cruise is an American wrestler who works in America and Canada. She is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Powerhouse style. She is best known for her work with AEW, SHIMMER and AIW.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":52,"storytelling":55,"productFit":58,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":56,"psychology":52,"workerManagement":58,"trainingIntensity":52,"technicalCoaching":40,"characterCoaching":48,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":73,"mediaHandling":48,"brandBuilding":40,"socialMediaSavvy":45,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":12,"reactionSpeed":52,"consistency":70,"awareness":52,"judgement":54},"picture":"Melanie Cruise_alt1.png"},{"id":672,"name":"Rhia O'Reilly","realName":"Rhia O'Reilly","nickname":"","type":"writer","base":"Other","gender":"F","weight":143,"height":165,"dateOfBirth":"1985-05-13T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":66000,"popularity":4,"charisma":59,"micSkills":48,"condition":72,"hardcoreAbility":59,"injuryProne":100,"ability":66,"currentAbility":58,"potentialAbility":58,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Rhia O'Reilly is an Irish female wrestler currently working for various indy promotions, including SHIMMER in the United States. Rhia is a feisty and intense young athlete who isn’t afraid to fight dirty to get to the top. Having trained with Jimmy Havoc, Justin Richards as well as with Lance Storm at his world-famous wrestling school, it’s no surprise that Rhia has become a big success story in the UK and continues to impress here in SWA! Having made her debut on the first Pro Wrestling Eve event, O’Reilly has since exploded across the UK wrestling the likes of Sarayah Night, Cheerleader Melissa, MsChief and many more. Her impressive talents have led to Rhia becoming a welcomed regular feature in SWA, battling the best Scotland has to offer and joining the invite-only showcase events at the Source Wrestling School. She has held the WAR Women's Championship in Switzerland.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Unknown","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1294,2579,2586],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":44,"storytelling":50,"productFit":78,"riskTaking":25,"matchLayout":52,"psychology":44,"workerManagement":78,"trainingIntensity":69,"technicalCoaching":52,"characterCoaching":59,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":75,"mediaHandling":59,"brandBuilding":38,"socialMediaSavvy":47,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":16,"reactionSpeed":69,"consistency":65,"awareness":44,"judgement":58},"picture":"Rhia Oreilly.png"},{"id":673,"name":"Allysin Kay","realName":"Allysin Kay","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":79,"base":"USA","gender":"F","weight":150,"height":175,"dateOfBirth":"1987-11-05T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":32800,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":18,"charisma":70,"micSkills":66,"condition":86,"hardcoreAbility":55,"injuryProne":100,"ability":63,"currentAbility":57,"potentialAbility":61,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Allysin Kay is an American wrestler who works in America, Canada, the British Isles and Japan. She is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Technician style. She is best known for her work with WWE, AAA, IMPACT, TJPW, ROH, NWA, RevPro, Sendai Girls, SHIMMER, Beyond, EVOLVE, AAW, AIW, Smash, EVE and SWE.","alterEgos":["Sienna"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2027-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-673","wrestlerId":673,"promotionId":79,"startDate":"2025-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","wage":32800,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2612,2643,3333,3476,3477,3478,3479,4006],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":57,"storytelling":62,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":17,"matchLayout":63,"psychology":57,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":76,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":67,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":83,"mediaHandling":67,"brandBuilding":68,"socialMediaSavvy":62,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":76,"consistency":85,"awareness":57,"judgement":74},"picture":"Allysin Kay_alt4.png"},{"id":675,"name":"Charlie","realName":"Dakota Kai","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Australia","gender":"F","weight":128,"height":162,"dateOfBirth":"1988-05-06T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2007-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":4166,"popularity":41,"charisma":72,"micSkills":86,"condition":75,"hardcoreAbility":63,"injuryProne":72,"ability":59,"currentAbility":59,"potentialAbility":74,"morale":"fair","presentation":"face","prestige":"mid","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"If you’ve seen a woman kick her opponent so hard that chirping cartoon birds pop out at any point over the last 10 years, there’s a good chance it was New Zealand’s Dakota Kai doing the kicking. A former high school track-and-field standout, Kai claims to be your ordinary girl next door, but we’ve yet to live next to someone who can jack jaws the way Kai does. The kick-happy Kiwi perfected her striking ability on the international independent scene for years, competing from Australasia to Japan, before joining the WWE Performance Center in 2017. Kai’s introduction to the WWE Universe came months later, during the inaugural Mae Young Classic, where The Captain of Team Kick stomped her way to the Quarterfinals before being ousted by eventual tournament winner Kairi Sane.","alterEgos":["Dakota Kai","Evie"],"birthplace":"New Zealand","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[568,1363,1942,2806],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":67,"storytelling":70,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":21,"matchLayout":71,"psychology":67,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":80,"technicalCoaching":65,"characterCoaching":73,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":79,"mediaHandling":73,"brandBuilding":73,"socialMediaSavvy":64,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":80,"consistency":75,"awareness":67,"judgement":80},"picture":"Evie_alt15.png"},{"id":676,"name":"Kimber Lee","realName":"Kimber Lee","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","