co Palacios is an American professional wrestler better known as Azrieal and for his appearences in the Northeast with some of the major American indy promotions like ROH, JAPW and CZW. On June 23, 2011, Palacios made an appearance on Total Nonstop Action Wrestling's Impact Wrestling television show, losing to Zema Ion in a three–way match, which also included Dakota Darsow.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[939,2652,2746,2991],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":44,"storytelling":49,"productFit":70,"riskTaking":47,"matchLayout":51,"psychology":44,"workerManagement":70,"trainingIntensity":73,"technicalCoaching":55,"characterCoaching":56,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":53,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":30,"socialMediaSavvy":44,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":14,"reactionSpeed":73,"consistency":69,"awareness":44,"judgement":54},"picture":"Azrieal.png"},{"id":761,"name":"DJ Hyde","realName":"DJ Hyde","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":299,"height":190,"dateOfBirth":"1978-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2003-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":3,"charisma":31,"micSkills":37,"condition":64,"hardcoreAbility":29,"injuryProne":100,"ability":47,"currentAbility":35,"potentialAbility":37,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"hardcore","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"David Markland is an American professional wrestler best known as DJ Hyde. A graduate of the CZW Wrestling Academy, he debuted for CZW in 2003. He went on to have a memorable feud with Danny Havoc. He eventually went on to join the MBA (Maven Bentley Association) where he teamed frequently with Brain Damage. After the group disbanded D.J. went on to compete for the CZW Ironman championship which he has four-times in his career. For a short stint D.J. was released from CZW, But returned shortly after he acquired the company from its owner John Zandig. D.J. now wrestles and acts as the on-screen authority for CZW.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":48,"storytelling":50,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":51,"matchLayout":50,"psychology":48,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":55,"technicalCoaching":22,"characterCoaching":58,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":49,"mediaHandling":58,"brandBuilding":20,"socialMediaSavvy":42,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":55,"consistency":68,"awareness":48,"judgement":69},"picture":"DJ Hyde.png"},{"id":762,"name":"Eddie Orengo","realName":"Eddie Orengo","nickname":"","type":"referee","promotionId":65,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":167,"height":172,"dateOfBirth":"1987-04-18T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2003-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":20500,"wageType":"monthly","popularity":3,"charisma":71,"micSkills":57,"condition":87,"hardcoreAbility":61,"injuryProne":100,"ability":62,"currentAbility":56,"potentialAbility":56,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":true,"story":"Eddie Orengo is a retired American wrestler who works primarily as a referee. He is best known for his work with NXT and CZW.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-762","wrestlerId":762,"promotionId":65,"startDate":"2018-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":20500,"wageType":"monthly","type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[939],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":38,"storytelling":47,"productFit":77,"riskTaking":49,"matchLayout":50,"psychology":38,"workerManagement":77,"trainingIntensity":73,"technicalCoaching":44,"characterCoaching":58,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":51,"mediaHandling":58,"brandBuilding":38,"socialMediaSavvy":53,"ruleKnowledge":66,"positioning":68,"reactionSpeed":73,"consistency":70,"awareness":38,"judgement":54},"picture":"Eddie Orengo.png"},{"id":765,"name":"Drew Gulak","realName":"Drew Gulak","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":193,"height":182,"dateOfBirth":"1987-04-28T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2005-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":25,"charisma":83,"micSkills":56,"condition":85,"hardcoreAbility":54,"injuryProne":100,"ability":61,"currentAbility":55,"potentialAbility":79,"morale":"poor","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Drew Gulak is every bit as hard-nosed as the city he hails from, Philadelphia. \r\n\r\nA minimalist mutilator, what Gulak lacks in frills like kneepads or elbow pads he offsets with a completist’s arsenal of submission holds and suplexes, not to mention a lariat that can rip heads from shoulders, as his competition discovered in the inaugural WWE Cruiserweight Classic.\r\n\r\nBeing raised in Philly did more than toughen up Gulak; it also exposed the self-described “student of the game” to one of the world’s top wrestling hotbeds at a young age. Now an 11-year veteran of the sport, the old-school throwback emerged as one of the Cruiserweight Division’s most promising competitors.","alterEgos":["Soldier Ant"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[986,1087,2738],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":75,"storytelling":78,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":15,"matchLayout":79,"psychology":75,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":79,"technicalCoaching":79,"characterCoaching":65,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":85,"mediaHandling":65,"brandBuilding":44,"socialMediaSavvy":68,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":79,"consistency":83,"awareness":75,"judgement":85},"picture":"Drew Gulak_alt9.png"},{"id":767,"name":"Joseph Sawyer","realName":"Joe Gacy","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":28,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":249,"height":180,"dateOfBirth":"1987-08-08T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2007-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":13100,"wageType":"monthly","popularity":32,"charisma":68,"micSkills":83,"condition":85,"hardcoreAbility":69,"injuryProne":100,"ability":63,"currentAbility":63,"potentialAbility":77,"morale":"poor","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"striker","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"strike","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"A highly-decorated independent brawler since 2006, Joe Gacy has now fought his way into the competitive world of NXT and shown true grit in the 2021 NXT Breakout Tournament. Many an unfortunate opponent have felt the force of the burly brawler’s arsenal of chops, headbutts and an earth-shattering clothesline off the ropes. Without a doubt, anyone who gets in the way of tough-as-nails Gacy better count his teeth once the action is done.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2027-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-5459","wrestlerId":767,"promotionId":77,"startDate":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":13100,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1851,2808,3398],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":55,"storytelling":59,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":44,"matchLayout":60,"psychology":55,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":68,"technicalCoaching":29,"characterCoaching":62,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":56,"mediaHandling":62,"brandBuilding":38,"socialMediaSavvy":55,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":68,"consistency":84,"awareness":55,"judgement":73},"picture":"Joe Gacy_alt7.png"},{"id":768,"name":"Masada","realName":"Masada","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":230,"height":185,"dateOfBirth":"1981-06-16T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2002-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":3,"charisma":75,"micSkills":53,"condition":69,"hardcoreAbility":62,"injuryProne":100,"ability":73,"currentAbility":59,"potentialAbility":61,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"hardcore","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Brigham Doane is an American professional wrestler. He is best known by his ring name Masada as well as well for his appearances in Ring of Honor, Full Impact Pro, NWA Wildside, and his tours with Big Japan Pro Wrestling. He has also wrestled matches for World Wrestling Entertainment and Total Nonstop Action Wrestling. Doane was first trained by Steve Oubre at the IWA training center in Orange, Texas and later by Rudy Roy Gonzalez and Shawn Michaels at the Texas Wrestling Academy. He then began his professional career by debuting in the Coastal States Wrestling Alliance (CSWA) before moving to Ring of Honor as a member of The Carnage Crew with HC Loc, DeVito, and later Justin Credible. Along with ROH, Masada wrestled for many other companies. He wrestled alongside Jared Steele and Delirious against 3 Live Kru in a dark match for TNA as well against Maven on WWE Heat. Masada also wrestled for IWA Mid-South, Full Impact Pro, and NWA Wildside.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2875],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":61,"storytelling":64,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":45,"matchLayout":65,"psychology":61,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":71,"technicalCoaching":58,"characterCoaching":66,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":55,"mediaHandling":66,"brandBuilding":57,"socialMediaSavvy":55,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":71,"consistency":77,"awareness":61,"judgement":77},"picture":"Masada.png"},{"id":769,"name":"The Blade","realName":"The Blade","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":77,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":220,"height":180,"dateOfBirth":"1980-06-03T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2000-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":26200,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":22,"charisma":89,"micSkills":60,"condition":70,"hardcoreAbility":65,"injuryProne":100,"ability":68,"currentAbility":68,"potentialAbility":70,"morale":"poor","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"The Blade is an American wrestler who works in America and Canada. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Regular style. He is one half of The Butcher & The Blade alongside The Butcher. He is best known for his work with AEW, IMPACT, HOH, ZERO1, Beyond, Smash, C4 and CZW. He is married to Allie.","alterEgos":["Braxton Sutter","Pepper Parks"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2028-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-769","wrestlerId":769,"promotionId":77,"startDate":"2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2028-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":26200,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[907,1787,1955,1956,2137,4395],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":69,"storytelling":71,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":22,"matchLayout":72,"psychology":69,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":76,"technicalCoaching":54,"characterCoaching":64,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":78,"mediaHandling":64,"brandBuilding":57,"socialMediaSavvy":58,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":76,"consistency":82,"awareness":69,"judgement":81},"picture":"The Blade.png"},{"id":770,"name":"Rich Swann","realName":"Rich Swann","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":118,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":200,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1991-02-15T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":21000,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":22,"charisma":69,"micSkills":68,"condition":89,"hardcoreAbility":66,"injuryProne":100,"ability":59,"currentAbility":57,"potentialAbility":63,"morale":"poor","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"An agile acrobat with a fondness for showboating, Rich Swann an exciting part of the Cruiserweight Division.\r\n\r\nThe squared circle became an outlet for Swann to show his passion after a rough upbringing. He immediately took to the mat game and found inspiration in a generation of cruiserweight wrestlers like Eddie Guerrero, Rey Mysterio and Psicosis. Swann made a name for himself on the independent scene by adapting that high-flying style, dazzling audiences around the world with moves like his trademark standing 450 Splash. He also hooked crowds with his infectious charisma, often turning his entrances into karaoke parties, asking his rivals one question: Can you handle this?","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2027-03-14T00:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-770","wrestlerId":770,"promotionId":118,"startDate":"2025-03-14T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-03-14T00:00:00.000Z","wage":21000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1106,1797,1958,3938],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":55,"storytelling":61,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":42,"matchLayout":63,"psychology":55,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":79,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":72,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":58,"mediaHandling":72,"brandBuilding":45,"socialMediaSavvy":48,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":79,"consistency":72,"awareness":55,"judgement":73},"picture":"Rich Swann.png"},{"id":772,"name":"Ruckus","realName":"Ruckus","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":235,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1978-08-15T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1999-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":44,"micSkills":48,"condition":96,"hardcoreAbility":65,"injuryProne":100,"ability":44,"currentAbility":33,"potentialAbility":35,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Claude Marrow is an American independent professional wrestler better known by his ring name Ruckus. Marrow current performs in Combat Zone Wrestling, Ring of Honor, Maryland Championship Wrestling, Chikara and Jersey All Pro Wrestling. While often appearing at a number of other independent promotions, Ruckus is a member of the Blackout/BLKOUT stable with Eddie Kingston, Sabian, Joker, and Robbie Mireno. Ruckus began training in September 1998 at Brainbusters. A former backyard wrestler with HCW (Hardcore Championship Wrestling), Ruckus made his official professional wrestling debut against Chad Olsen on April 18, 1999 for the Mid-Eastern Wrestling Federation (MEWF).","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[951,3201,3202],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":36,"storytelling":44,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":47,"psychology":36,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":75,"technicalCoaching":55,"characterCoaching":67,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":63,"mediaHandling":67,"brandBuilding":46,"socialMediaSavvy":59,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":75,"consistency":70,"awareness":36,"judgement":62},"picture":"Ruckus.png"},{"id":774,"name":"BLK Jeez","realName":"BLK Jeez","nickname":"","type":"manager","promotionId":79,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":160,"height":165,"dateOfBirth":"1975-04-25T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2000-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":16400,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":4,"charisma":58,"micSkills":50,"condition":73,"hardcoreAbility":64,"injuryProne":100,"ability":47,"currentAbility":32,"potentialAbility":32,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"BLK Jeez is an American wrestler who works in America and Canada. He is a Small worker who is classed as using a Daredevil style. He is one half of BLKOUT alongside Ruckus. He is best known for his work with NWA, BJW, ICW NHB, IWA-MS, C4, CHIKARA and CZW.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-774","wrestlerId":774,"promotionId":79,"startDate":"2021-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":16400,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[907,951,3199,3200,3201,3202,3205],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":54,"storytelling":59,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":40,"matchLayout":61,"psychology":54,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":62,"technicalCoaching":44,"characterCoaching":68,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":60,"mediaHandling":68,"brandBuilding":35,"socialMediaSavvy":66,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":62,"consistency":68,"awareness":54,"judgement":72},"picture":"BLK Jeez.png"},{"id":775,"name":"Matt Tremont","realName":"Matt Tremont","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":250,"height":172,"dateOfBirth":"1989-03-09T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2010-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":4,"charisma":33,"micSkills":62,"condition":69,"hardcoreAbility":55,"injuryProne":100,"ability":41,"currentAbility":39,"potentialAbility":44,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"hardcore","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"\"Bulldozer\" Matt Tremont is an American professional wrestler who currently works for Combat Zone Wrestling (CZW) and westside Xtreme wrestling (wXw). In addition he has appeared in IWA Mid-South, IWA Deep-South and IWA East Coast where he is the winner of Masters of Pain in 2012. Tremont made his Combat Zone Wrestling debut at Prelude to Violence defeating Pinkie Sanchez in a Tournament of Death X Qualifying Ultraviolent Rules on June 11, 2012. Tremont began to feud with CZW Owner DJ Hyde throughout 2012 beginning at A Tangled Web between the two as Hyde was the victor. Tremont was subsequently fired.  DJ Hyde cut a promo on not reinstating Tremont. Prompting the locker room to walk out and quit if Tremont is not reinstated, but Hyde insisted if Tremont wins a match he could be reinstated.","alterEgos":["KillDozer"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2969,3399,3400,3401,4299,4337],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":45,"storytelling":48,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":49,"psychology":45,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":53,"technicalCoaching":22,"characterCoaching":63,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":63,"mediaHandling":63,"brandBuilding":15,"socialMediaSavvy":51,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":53,"consistency":68,"awareness":45,"judgement":67},"picture":"Matt Tremont.png"},{"id":777,"name":"Eric Corvis","realName":"Eric Corvis","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":200,"height":180,"dateOfBirth":"1984-07-03T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2001-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":2,"charisma":53,"micSkills":36,"condition":79,"hardcoreAbility":28,"injuryProne":100,"ability":38,"currentAbility":33,"potentialAbility":36,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Eric Haraskin is an American professional wrestler better known by his ring names, Corvis Fear and Eric Corvis. Corvis made his in ring debut in October 2001 after training from Mafia, MAGIC, Skinhead Ivan. He is most notable for the time he spent with the CZW promotion.","alterEgos":["Corvis Fear"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":44,"storytelling":49,"productFit":90,"riskTaking":53,"matchLayout":50,"psychology":44,"workerManagement":90,"trainingIntensity":69,"technicalCoaching":38,"characterCoaching":62,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":47,"mediaHandling":62,"brandBuilding":49,"socialMediaSavvy":51,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":18,"reactionSpeed":69,"consistency":75,"awareness":44,"judgement":62},"picture":"Eric Corvis.png"},{"id":780,"name":"Lucky 13","realName":"Lucky 13","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":185,"height":165,"dateOfBirth":"1984-09-19T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":52,"micSkills":25,"condition":90,"hardcoreAbility":25,"injuryProne":100,"ability":32,"currentAbility":28,"potentialAbility":31,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"hardcore","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Kevin Papics better known by his ring names Retail Dragon in Chikara and Lucky, tHURTeen or Lucky 13 in Combat Zone Wrestling (CZW) is an American professional wrestler. Papics was trained at the Chikara Wrestle Factory by Mike Quackenbush and Chris Hero and debuted for Chikara in 2005. While in Chikara he wrestled as the Retail Dragon; nicknamed the \"Xtreme Customer Service Specialist\" and whilst there he formed a tag team with Dragon Dragon, known as Triple Dragon. In conjunction with apprearing in Chikara, Papics wrestled as \"Lucky\" in Pro Wrestling Unplugged and several other independent promotions, including CZW, where he tagged with JC Ryder as \"the New Jersey All Stars.\" In 2010 Papics made his return to Combat Zone Wrestling as \"tHURTeen\", a wild character under the tuteledge of Billy Gram in the heel stable Cult Fiction.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1949],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":40,"storytelling":45,"productFit":55,"riskTaking":50,"matchLayout":47,"psychology":40,"workerManagement":55,"trainingIntensity":66,"technicalCoaching":18,"characterCoaching":55,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":50,"mediaHandling":55,"brandBuilding":26,"socialMediaSavvy":38,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":11,"reactionSpeed":66,"consistency":66,"awareness":40,"judgement":46},"picture":"Lucky 13.png"},{"id":783,"name":"Jake Black","realName":"Jake Black","nickname":"","type":"commentator","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":147,"height":162,"dateOfBirth":"1978-05-18T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2003-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":66000,"popularity":1,"charisma":40,"micSkills":56,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":29,"injuryProne":100,"ability":33,"currentAbility":25,"potentialAbility":27,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Jake Black is a colour commentator for CZW.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":0,"storytelling":0,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":100,"matchLayout":0,"psychology":0,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":0,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":65,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":0,"mediaHandling":65,"brandBuilding":9,"socialMediaSavvy":33,"ruleKnowledge":0,