 in Ryukyu Dragon Pro Wrestling. A small dimunitive wrestler, but he has that firecracker spirit and will to succeed.","alterEgos":["Mil Mongoose"],"birthplace":"Japan","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":54,"storytelling":60,"productFit":86,"riskTaking":28,"matchLayout":62,"psychology":54,"workerManagement":86,"trainingIntensity":73,"technicalCoaching":50,"characterCoaching":62,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":72,"mediaHandling":62,"brandBuilding":42,"socialMediaSavvy":56,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":17,"reactionSpeed":73,"consistency":76,"awareness":54,"judgement":67},"picture":"Churaumi Saver.png"},{"id":876,"name":"Alpha Female","realName":"Alpha Female","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Europe","gender":"F","weight":198,"height":182,"dateOfBirth":"1982-06-04T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2001-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":13,"charisma":50,"micSkills":65,"condition":83,"hardcoreAbility":58,"injuryProne":100,"ability":60,"currentAbility":50,"potentialAbility":60,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"powerhouse","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Marie Kristin Gabert is an German professional wrestler who works under the ring name Alpha Female who currently works for all over Europe and in Japan for Stardom. Crush. Kill. Destroy. This is all that seems to go through the mind of The Alpha Female once she steps into the ring.","alterEgos":["Jazzy Gabert"],"birthplace":"Turkey","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1616],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":61,"storytelling":63,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":33,"matchLayout":64,"psychology":61,"workerManagement":100,"trainin