","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Vicky Owen is a British professional wrestler who wrestles as Jetta. She is best known for her work on the independent circuit in England. Perhaps the most successful British female wrestler of the 21st century, Jetta has main-evented shows across the world, however, has always seemed to fall just short of proving what she claims to be: the best in the world. She has primarily performed as a villainous character, using the gimmick of an arrogant and outspoken individual earning her the name 'Coventry's Loudest'.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"England","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2584,2950,3489,3490,3735],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":54,"storytelling":59,"productFit":65,"riskTaking":33,"matchLayout":61,"psychology":54,"workerManagement":65,"trainingIntensity":67,"technicalCoaching":55,"characterCoaching":69,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":67,"mediaHandling":69,"brandBuilding":49,"socialMediaSavvy":60,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":13,"reactionSpeed":67,"consistency":73,"awareness":54,"judgement":58},"picture":"Jetta.png"},{"id":884,"name":"Emi Sakura","realName":"Emi Sakura","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":49,"base":"Japan","gender":"F","weight":154,"height":154,"dateOfBirth":"1976-10-04T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1995-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":24600,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":23,"charisma":68,"micSkills":70,"condition":78,"hardcoreAbility":92,"injuryProne":100,"ability":63,"currentAbility":63,"potentialAbility":65,"morale":"poor","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Emi Sakura is a Japanese womens professional wrestler who is currently a freelancer. Emi is a long time wrestler who is incredibly well traveled. Emi started Ice Ribbon in the mid-naughts but is now looking to create a new promotion in Thailand. Because of this she has become a true freelancer, only looking to come to Japan to do a few shows here and there while her new company gets set up. Emi is a great all arounder with the abillity to have a good match with almost anyone, and is also a fantastic trainer.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Kimitsu, Chiba, Japan","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-884","wrestlerId":884,"promotionId":49,"startDate":"2019-05-25T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":24600,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2506,2719,2720],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":85,"storytelling":87,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":22,"matchLayout":87,"psychology":85,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":77,"technicalCoaching":78,"characterCoaching":76,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":78,"mediaHandling":76,"brandBuilding":45,"socialMediaSavvy":73,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":77,"consistency":80,"awareness":85,"judgement":91},"picture":"Emi Sakura_alt6.png"},{"id":885,"name":"Ayesha Raymond","realName":"Ayesha Raymond","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"UK","gender":"F","weight":203,"height":180,"dateOfBirth":"1989-09-24T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":2,"charisma":40,"micSkills":58,"condition":90,"hardcoreAbility":48,"injuryProne":100,"ability":51,"currentAbility":48,"potentialAbility":53,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"powerhouse","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"po