g future Death Match innovator Atsushi Onita. On July 14 2013, during the launching event of the post-Keiji Mutoh All Japan, Fuchi appeared and announced that he had officially re-signed with AJPW not only as a wrestler, but also as a member of the Board of Directors.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Japan","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-914","wrestlerId":914,"promotionId":3,"startDate":"1983-08-19T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":25600,"wageType":"monthly","type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2883,2884],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":80,"storytelling":85,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":28,"matchLayout":86,"psychology":80,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":54,"technicalCoaching":68,"characterCoaching":31,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":72,"mediaHandling":31,"brandBuilding":28,"socialMediaSavvy":31,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":54,"consistency":56,"awareness":80,"judgement":88},"picture":"Masanobu Fuchi.png"},{"id":916,"name":"Seiki Yoshioka","realName":"Seiki Yoshioka","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":3,"base":"Japan","gender":"M","weight":169,"height":167,"dateOfBirth":"1988-01-05T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":38400,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":5,"charisma":50,"micSkills":65,"condition":93,"hardcoreAbility":41,"injuryProne":100,"ability":69,"currentAbility":64,"potentialAbility":69,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Seiki Yoshioka is a Japanese wrestler who works in the British Isles and Japan. He is a 5'7\", 169lb worker who is classed as using a Technician Flyer style. He uses the Zero Shootout as his finisher. He is best known for his work with NOAH, AJPW, ZERO1, GLEAT, WRESTLE-1 and FCP. He is married to someone outside the wrestling business.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Japan","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-916","wrestlerId":916,"promotionId":3,"startDate":"2024-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":38400,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2957,3460,4294],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":67,"storytelling":71,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":21,"matchLayout":72,"psychology":67,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":84,"technicalCoaching":68,"characterCoaching":48,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":79,"mediaHandling":48,"brandBuilding":54,"socialMediaSavvy":33,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":84,"consistency":73,"awareness":67,"judgement":80},"picture":"Seiki Yoshioka.png"},{"id":917,"name":"Addy Starr","realName":"Addy Starr","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Canada","gender":"F","weight":110,"height":154,"dateOfBirth":"1988-07-08T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2006-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":52,"micSkills":35,"condition":89,"hardcoreAbility":59,"injuryProne":100,"ability":39,"currentAbility":36,"potentialAbility":36,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"striker","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"strike","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Addy Starr is a Canadian wrestler who works in America, Canada and the British Isles. She is a Small worker who is classed as using a Brawler style. She is best known for her work with RevPro, Beyond, 