ment":false,"story":"Son of the legendary Canek. Made his debut in IWRG, but spent more time as a CMLL regular from April 2005 to early 2007 (with some scattered appearances after that.) Despite wrestling with CMLL for almost two years, the first appearance was the only time he's wrestled Arena Mexico. Believed to be introduced to appease his father. Wrestles as a independent, including working on the ENESMA reborn shows. Seems to be working with Axxel as a regular indy feud around the country. Has wrestled in Arena Naucalpan a few time since late 2009, usually in father/son pairings or tournaments of juniors.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":56,"storytelling":58,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":25,"matchLayout":59,"psychology":56,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":80,"technicalCoaching":61,"characterCoaching":43,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":75,"mediaHandling":43,"brandBuilding":64,"socialMediaSavvy":38,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":80,"consistency":77,"awareness":56,"judgement":74},"picture":"El Hijo de Canek.png"},{"id":925,"name":"Cheech","realName":"Cheech","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":185,"height":180,"dateOfBirth":"1984-03-05T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2004-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":3,"charisma":47,"micSkills":53,"condition":88,"hardcoreAbility":37,"injuryProne":100,"ability":51,"currentAbility":44,"potentialAbility":47,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Cheech is an American professional wrestler, also known as Cheech Hernandez. He made his pro debut in 2004 and was a member of the Special K faction alongside the likes of Joey Matthews, Dixie, Cloudy, Jody Fleisch & Mikey Whipwreck (among others) in ROH. He debuted in CHIKARA in 2005 alongside his long-time \"Up in Smoke\" tag team partner Cloudy, initially representing Special K and ROH before they left the company and became full-time members of the CHIKARA roster.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1539,2057,2136],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":45,"storytelling":52,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":44,"matchLayout":54,"psychology":45,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":74,"technicalCoaching":51,"characterCoaching":56,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":56,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":28,"socialMediaSavvy":42,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":74,"consistency":64,"awareness":45,"judgement":67},"picture":"Cheech.png"},{"id":926,"name":"Colin Delaney","realName":"Colin Delaney","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":172,"height":172,"dateOfBirth":"1986-09-07T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2004-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":3,"charisma":51,"micSkills":56,"condition":89,"hardcoreAbility":61,"injuryProne":95,"ability":57,"currentAbility":51,"potentialAbility":55,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Colin Matthew Delaney is an American professional wrestler, best known for wrestling for World Wrestling Entertainment. He has also wrestled for promotions such as Ultimate Wrestling, 2CW Squared Circle Wrestling, Chikara, NWA Upstate, Pier 6 Wrestling, Buffalo Championship Wrestling, NWA Empire, LakeShore Wrestling, Pro Wrestling Ohio, UWA Hardcore Wrestling, Roc City Wrestling, Combat Zone Wrestling, and the International Wrestling Cartel under the names Colin Olsen and the \"Extremely Cute Wrestler\" Colin Delaney. Colin's brother, Ed, currently wrestles in the New York area under the name \"Freddie Midnight.\" He and former tag team partner Jimmy \"Equinox II\" Olsen are not real life brothers.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1539,2136],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":55,"storytelling":60,"productFit":50,"riskTaking":29,"matchLayout":61,"psychology":55,"workerManagement":50,"trainingIntensity":66,"technicalCoaching":51,"characterCoaching":64,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":71,"mediaHandling":64,"brandBuilding":44,"socialMediaSavvy":62,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":10,"reactionSpeed":66,"consistency":69,"awareness":55,"judgement":53},"picture":"Colin Delaney.png"},{"id":928,"name":"Dalton Castle","realName":"Dalton Castle","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":49,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":218,"height":177,"dateOfBirth":"1986-03-04T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":16400,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":14,"charisma":72,"micSkills":81,"condition":79,"hardcoreAbility":84,"injuryProne":83,"ability":65,"currentAbility":65,"potentialAbility":69,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":true,"story":"With his Liberace-like entrance, flamboyant personality and ever-present Boys, Dalton Castle is one of the most unique competitors to ever step foot inside a Ring of Honor ring. But Castle is much more than a showman. Underneath the pomp and circumstance is a highly skilled and intense wrestler who was a standout in the amateur and collegiate ranks before turning pro.\r\n\r\nAfter participating in the 2015 Top Prospect Tournament, Castle signed with ROH and gradually worked his way up the card. He erased any doubts about his toughness when he defeated bitter rival Silas Young in a Fight Without Honor in 2016. “The Peacock” reached the pinnacle of the sport when he won the ROH World Championship from Cody at Final Battle 2017.","alterEgos":["Ashley Remmington"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-928","wrestlerId":928,"promotionId":49,"startDate":"2013-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":16400,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1974,2648],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":64,"storytelling":67,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":23,"matchLayout":68,"psychology":64,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":79,"technicalCoaching":69,"characterCoaching":79,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":77,"mediaHandling":79,"brandBuilding":68,"socialMediaSavvy":74,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":79,"consistency":58,"awareness":64,"judgement":78},"picture":"Dalton Castle_alt3.png"},{"id":934,"name":"Jay Freddie","realName":"Jay Freddie","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":198,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1988-06-09T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":69,"micSkills":69,"condition":85,"hardcoreAbility":76,"injuryProne":100,"ability":58,"currentAbility":54,"potentialAbility":59,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopm