ne":100,"ability":59,"currentAbility":50,"potentialAbility":53,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"submission","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Heddi Karaoui is a French wrestler who works all over the world. He is a 5'10\", 220lb worker who is classed as using a MMA Crossover style. He uses the Chickenwing and the Knockout Punch as his finishers. He is best known for his work with CMLL, DDT, wXw, IWRG, BJW, GCW, BZW and NLL. Outside of wrestling he is a former MMA fighter.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"France","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":43,"storytelling":51,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":54,"psychology":43,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":82,"technicalCoaching":73,"characterCoaching":51,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":73,"mediaHandling":51,"brandBuilding":56,"socialMediaSavvy":36,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":82,"consistency":61,"awareness":43,"judgement":66},"picture":"Heddi Karaoui.png"},{"id":1036,"name":"Mark Andrews","realName":"Mark Andrews","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"UK","gender":"M","weight":161,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1992-01-25T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2006-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":18,"charisma":52,"micSkills":43,"condition":90,"hardcoreAbility":75,"injuryProne":100,"ability":49,"currentAbility":48,"potentialAbility":75,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"When Mark Andrews hits the ring, one thing is clear: It’s time to fly.\r\n\r\nInspired by the likes of Rey Mysterio and Shawn Michaels, Andrews is a high-flyer of the finest caliber. With a picture-perfect Shooting Star Press and Standing Moonsault among the many dazzling aerial attacks in his arsenal, Andrews possesses a unique skillset that makes him stand out from others in the NXT UK scene.\r\n\r\nAndrews is a bit of a renaissance man, too, counting videography, video editing, graphic design and clothing design among his many skills. Plus, he’s the bassist and vocalist in the Welsh pop-punk outfit Junior. More than anything, he’s a top-tier competitor.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Wales","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[728,944,1058,1849,2197,2357,3734,3930,3931],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":54,"storytelling":61,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":24,"matchLayout":63,"psychology":54,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":79,"technicalCoaching":53,"characterCoaching":56,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":76,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":48,"socialMediaSavvy":44,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":79,"consistency":67,"awareness":54,"judgement":72},"picture":"Mark Andrews_alt5.png"},{"id":1037,"name":"Zumbi","realName":"Zumbi","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Other","gender":"M","weight":167,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1984-12-24T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2007-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":35,"micSkills":36,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":38,"injuryProne":100,"ability":41,"currentAbility":35,"potentialAbility":38,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Zumbi is a masked Brazilian wrestler who was trained by El Mexicano. He performs in his home country for the Brazilian Wrestling Federation as well as appearing in Puerto Rico and Mexico for various promotions. He is a master in Capoeira and uses this in his wrestling style, pulling off some very unique moves.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Brazil","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":42,"storytelling":48,"productFit":40,"riskTaking":47,"matchLayout":50,"psychology":42,"workerManagement":40,"trainingIntensity":84,"technicalCoaching":54,"characterCoaching":34,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":53,"mediaHandling":34,"brandBuilding":23,"socialMediaSavvy":20,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":8,"reactionSpeed":84,"consistency":62,"awareness":42,"judgement":41},"picture":"Zumbi.png"},{"id":1039,"name":"Super Nova","realName":"Super Nova","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":170,"height":162,"dateOfBirth":"1986-06-29T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2002-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":6,"charisma":48,"micSkills":58,"condition":82,"hardcoreAbility":69,"injuryProne":100,"ability":62,"currentAbility":55,"potentialAbility":59,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Super Nova is the current ring name of a Mexican Luchador enmascarado, Super Nova is the son of Luchador El Texano and the brother of El Texano, Jr. in addition to being the cousin of another Luchador called Mictlán. Súper Nova's real name is not a matter of public record, as is often the case with masked wrestlers in Mexico where their private lives are kept a secret from the wrestling fans. Only his paternal surname is a matter of public record, Aguilar Leos, as his brother's real name, Juan Aguilar Leos, is publicly known.","alterEgos":["Bengala"],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3356,3648,4243],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":57,"storytelling":62,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":21,"matchLayout":64,"psychology":57,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":76,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":53,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":79,"mediaHandling":53,"brandBuilding":49,"socialMediaSavvy":44,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":76,"consistency":74,"awareness":57,"judgement":74},"picture":"Super Nova.png"},{"id":1040,"name":"Buggy Nova","realName":"Buggy Nova","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"F","weight":141,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1989-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":0,"charisma":49,"micSkills":23,"condition":98,"hardcoreAbility":44,"injuryProne":100,"ability":31,"currentAbility":29,"potentialAbility":29,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Natalie Laura Osman is an American professional wrestler and valet. She is known both for working for WWE in their developmental territory NXT Wrestling, under the ring name Skyler Moon, and for working for Southern California independent promotions including National Wrestling Alliance, Pro Wrestling Bushido, Mach One Wrestling, Empire Wrestling Federation, as well as Shimmer Women Athletes under the names Buggy Nova, or simply Buggy. After her non--compete clause ended, Osman returned to the independent circuit under the 'Buggy Nova name. Her first appearance came at Full Impact Pro Establish Dominance in which she accompanied The Scene and was used to persuade Kenneth Cameron into joining them, which she failed to do.","