ied the show in 2006. But after he relaunched in 2009, he has never looked back.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"England","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":40,"storytelling":39,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":69,"matchLayout":39,"psychology":40,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":33,"technicalCoaching":9,"characterCoaching":64,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":31,"mediaHandling":64,"brandBuilding":5,"socialMediaSavvy":58,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":0,"reactionSpeed":33,"consistency":22,"awareness":40,"judgement":24},"picture":"Mark Dallas.png"},{"id":1086,"name":"The Wee Man","realName":"The Wee Man","nickname":"","type":"manager","base":"UK","gender":"M","weight":155,"height":162,"dateOfBirth":"1983-10-24T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2006-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":66000,"popularity":0,"charisma":69,"micSkills":60,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":41,"injuryProne":30,"ability":44,"currentAbility":37,"potentialAbility":40,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Neil Bratchpiece is a Scottish stand up comedian better known by his stage name, The Wee Man whose greatest success was nabbing a place in the final of the Scottish Comedian of the Year Awards in 2006 and 2007. He also works for the ICW promotion and accompanies the NED tag team of the Bucky Boys to the ring.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Scotland","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":0,"storytelling":0,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":100,"matchLayout":0,"psychology":0,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":0,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":7