ican and a two-time NCAA All-American in college. Fresh out of college and new to the real world – Sawyer Fulton is here to show that even though he is one of the youngest superstars on the NXT roster, he is also one of the biggest and he will not stop until NXT gold is resting on his shoulder.","alterEgos":["Sawyer Fulton"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2332,2333,2512,2675],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":45,"storytelling":51,"productFit":92,"riskTaking":38,"matchLayout":53,"psychology":45,"workerManagement":92,"trainingIntensity":63,"technicalCoaching":29,"characterCoaching":51,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":62,"mediaHandling":51,"brandBuilding":68,"socialMediaSavvy":48,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":18,"reactionSpeed":63,"consistency":61,"awareness":45,"judgement":64},"picture":"Sawyer Fulton_alt5.png"},{"id":1274,"name":"Dak Draper","realName":"Dak Draper","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":246,"height":193,"dateOfBirth":"1988-03-20T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2012-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":5,"charisma":53,"micSkills":62,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":43,"injuryProne":100,"ability":66,"currentAbility":61,"potentialAbility":66,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"From a young age, “The Mile High Magnum” Dak Draper knew he was different. He always stood taller, ran faster, and jumped higher than his peers in his beloved home state, Colorado. Dak’s natural abilities made him a stand out wrestler and football player throughout high school and college. After the national wrestling tournament, his senior year of college, he began his professional wrestling training at the WWE Performance Center. Although his athletic pursuits have changed over time, his thirst for competition and more importantly, winning, have stayed the same. He has made it his goal to show that no man can stand toe to toe with the “Mile High Magnum“ and as his hand is raised in victory, he will be the first to tell his opponent “SHAME ON YOU!”","alterEgos":["Travis Tyler","Sam Udell"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3714],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":52,"storytelling":56,"productFit":48,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":58,"psychology":52,"workerManagement":48,"trainingIntensity":73,"technicalCoaching":46,"characterCoaching":58,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":73,"mediaHandling":58,"brandBuilding":72,"socialMediaSavvy":48,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":10,"reactionSpeed":73,"consistency":68,"awareness":52,"judgement":50},"picture":"Dak Draper.png"},{"id":1277,"name":"Buddy Matthews","realName":"Buddy Matthews","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":76,"base":"Australia","gender":"M","weight":224,"height":175,"dateOfBirth":"1988-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2007-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":60000,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":37,"charisma":78,"micSkills":84,"condition":90,"hardcoreAbility":81,"injuryProne":100,"ability":69,"currentAbility":69,"potentialAbility":84,"morale":"fair","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Buddy Matthews is an Australian wrestler who works in the USA, Canada, Japan and Oceania. He is a 5'10\", 224lb worker who is classed as using a Technician Striker style. He uses the Murphy's Law as his finisher. He is best known for his work with WWE, AEW, NXT and MCW. He is married to Rhea Ripley.","alterEgos":["Murphy"],"birthplace":"Melbourne, Victoria, Australia","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1277","wrestlerId":1277,"promotionId":76,"startDate":"2022-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":60000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[950,2073],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":68,"storytelling":72,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":25,"matchLayout":73,"psychology":68,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":84,"technicalCoaching":72,"characterCoaching":52,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":75,"mediaHandling":52,"brandBuilding":58,"socialMediaSavvy":38,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":84,"consistency":85,"awareness":68,"judgement":81},"picture":"Buddy Matthews.png","injury":{"type":"Torn Meniscus","daysToRecover":6},"returnDate":"2026-04-18T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":1283,"name":"Jakob Hammermeier","realName":"Jakob Hammermeier","nickname":"","type":"commentator","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":198,"height":177,"dateOfBirth":"1986-06-03T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":66000,"popularity":1,"charisma":51,"micSkills":47,"condition":93,"hardcoreAbility":56,"injuryProne":100,"ability":45,"currentAbility":40,"potentialAbility":40,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"powerhouse","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Troy Brolin, better known by his ring name Jakob Hammermeier is an American professional wrestler who is most notable for his appearances with CHIKARA as a member of Die Bruderschaft des Kreuzes stable. The Pennsylvania native is billed from Zurich, Switzerland.","alterEgos":["Dr. Cube II","Proletariat Boar"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3183],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":31,"storytelling":38,"productFit":40,"riskTaking":41,"matchLayout":41,"psychology":31,"workerManagement":40,"trainingIntensity":62,"technicalCoaching":54,"characterCoaching":49,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":59,"mediaHandling":49,"brandBuilding":24,"socialMediaSavvy":48,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":8,"reactionSpeed":62,"consistency":54,"awareness":31,"judgement":35},"picture":"Jakob Hammermeier.png"},{"id":1287,"name":"Bob Backlund","realName":"Bob Backlund","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":234,"height":182,"dateOfBirth":"1949-08-14T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1967-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":21,"charisma":63,"micSkills":56,"condition":59,"hardcoreAbility":33,"injuryProne":63,"ability":57,"currentAbility":26,"potentialAbility":26,"morale":"poor","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Bob Backlund experienced success as both an adored hero and a loathed villain in a WWE career that spanned across three decades. The kid from Princeton, Minn., quickly became a fan favorite and the seventh WWE Champion in the company’s history at Madison Square Garden in 1978. But when Backlund left WWE for good in the mid-1990s, he was a deranged madman despised by the fans for his outlandish behavior. It was a stunning transformation for the once beloved man who reigned atop sports-entertainment in the pre-Hogan era. \r\nBacklund’s impressive run at the top and subsequent descent into absurd lunacy makes for one of the most unique careers in WWE history. That’s why it was no surprise when the former WWE Champion was announced as an inductee into the WWE Hall of Fame’s Class of 2013.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3121],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":72,"storytelling":80,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":53,"matchLayout":82,"psychology":72,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":39,"technicalCoaching":37,"characterCoaching":44,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":47,"mediaHandling":44,"brandBuilding":28,"socialMediaSavvy":54,"ruleKnowledge":10,"positioning":28,"reactionSpeed":39,"consistency":28,"awareness":72,"judgement":83},"picture":"Bob Backlund.png"},{"id":1290,"name":"Solar","realName":"Solar","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":196,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1956-05-25T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1975-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":7,"charisma":71,"micSkills":58,"condition":58,"hardcoreAbility":65,"injuryProne":98,"ability":80,"currentAbility":37,"potentialAbility":39,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Solar is often known as “El Maestro”(“teacher” or “master”). He is the master of a classic wrestling technique that is rooted in holds and clinches but he also has a mastery of a more acrobatic style of wrestling. Solar was born in the state of Jalisco in the town of Zacoalco de Torres into a boyhood of rural poverty. After his family moved to Guadalajara, Solar went with a cousin to see lucha libre for the first time. He has said that, “with lucha libre, it was love at first sight.” He trained under the best lucha libre teachers of the era including El Diablo Velasco and Rene Guajardo. He has wrestled with, and against, the greatest wrestlers that have ever stepped into the ring including El Santo, Lou Thesz, El Solitario and Angel Blanco.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":88,"storytelling":88,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":13,"matchLayout":88,"psychology":88,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":48,"technicalCoaching":92,"characterCoaching":35,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":87,"mediaHandling":35,"brandBuilding":40,"socialMediaSavvy":30,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":48,"consistency":68,"awareness":88,"judgement":93},"picture":"Solar.png"},{"id":1292,"name":"Alex Reynolds","realName":"Alex Reynolds","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":49,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":196,"height":175,"dateOfBirth":"1987-03-10T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2006-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":24600,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":20,"charisma":56,"micSkills":66,"condition":85,"hardcoreAbility":78,"injuryProne":100,"ability":57,"currentAbility":52,"potentialAbility":56,"morale":"poor","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":true,"story":"Alex Reynolds is an American wrestler who works in America and Canada. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Regular style. He is one half of The Beaver Boys alongside John Silver. He is best known for his work with AEW, PWG, HOH, DEFY, Beyond, EVOLVE, AIW, A1, CHIKARA and CZW.","alterEgos":["CombatANT","Alex Keaton"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1292","wrestlerId":1292,"promotionId":49,"startDate":"2023-04-20T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage"