January 2010, Takase's ring name was shortened to just Leon and the following year, she won JWP's top title, the JWP Openweight Championship, while also becoming the leader of the Shishi no Ana stable.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Japan","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3347],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":78,"storytelling":80,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":80,"psychology":78,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":79,"technicalCoaching":70,"characterCoaching":52,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":73,"mediaHandling":52,"brandBuilding":40,"socialMediaSavvy":62,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":79,"consistency":80,"awareness":78,"judgement":87},"picture":"Leon.png"},{"id":1565,"name":"Kengo Mashimo","realName":"Kengo Mashimo","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":3,"base":"Japan","gender":"M","weight":216,"height":177,"dateOfBirth":"1978-11-25T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2001-04-27T00:00:00.000Z","wage":25600,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":3,"charisma":62,"micSkills":63,"condition":73,"hardcoreAbility":52,"injuryProne":100,"ability":54,"currentAbility":41,"potentialAbility":43,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Kengo Mashimo is a Japanese professional wrestler currently working for Kaientai Dojo. His style is a combination submission wrestling and hard, martial art strikes. He is currently the ace of Kaientai Dojo. In early 2014, Mashimo began working regularly for All Japan Pro Wrestling as a member of Kenso's Dark Kingdom stable.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Japan","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1565","wrestlerId":1565,"promotion