eBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Joe Hendry is a Scottish wrestler who works in the USA, the British Isles and Europe. He is a 6'2\", 231lb worker who is classed as using a Entertainer style. He uses the Freak of Nature as his finisher. He is best known for his work with TNA, NXT, ROH, NORTH, Smash, Defiant and ICW.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Edinburgh, Scotland","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1652","wrestlerId":1652,"promotionId":64,"startDate":"2025-04-20T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":50000,"wageType":"monthly","type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1462,1974,2654,3808],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":58,"storytelling":61,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":20,"matchLayout":62,"psychology":58,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":73,"technicalCoaching":54,"characterCoaching":82,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":80,"mediaHandling":82,"brandBuilding":72,"socialMediaSavvy":77,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":73,"consistency":68,"awareness":58,"judgement":75},"picture":"Joe Hendry.png"},{"id":1654,"name":"Jake Clemons","realName":"Jake Clemons","nickname":"","type":"referee","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":143,"height":162,"dateOfBirth":"1988-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2007-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":66000,"popularity":1,"charisma":39,"micSkills":41,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":33,"injuryProne":100,"ability":52,"currentAbility":48,"potentialAbility":53,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Jake Clemons is an American man who works primarily as a referee. He is best known for his work with NXT.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":0,"storytelling":0,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":100,"matchLayout":0,"psychology":0,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":0,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":10,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":0,"mediaHandling":10,"brandBuilding":10,"socialMediaSavvy":10,"ruleKnowledge":49,"positioning":39,"reactionSpeed":0,"consistency":0,"awareness":0,"judgement":0},"picture":"Jake Clemons.png"},{"id":1655,"name":"Timothy Thatcher","realName":"Timothy Thatcher","nickname":"","type":"scout","promotionId":65,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":224,"height":187,"dateOfBirth":"1983-03-17T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2005-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":20500,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":28,"charisma":43,"micSkills":58,"condition":91,"hardcoreAbility":40,"injuryProne":100,"ability":49,"currentAbility":41,"potentialAbility":44,"morale":"poor","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"The man that NXT announcer Wade Barrett has described as a “human torture device” sharpened his skills by competing around the world before coming to the black-and-gold brand in 2020. His impact was immediate, and within months of his debut, Thatcher dispatched of the double-tough Riddle, putting him to sleep in NXT’s first Fight Pit, an unforgiving caged fighting arena. Thatcher didn’t slow down from there, going on to pick fights with members of NXT’s master class, from Kushida to Tommaso Ciampa.\r\n\r\nTo observe Thatcher in practice is like watching an anaconda overwhelm its prey. He patiently devours his opponents, their cries of agony playing like a beautiful symphony in his head. His rear-naked choke is suffocating, his cravat just an excuse to twist necks like crankshafts. Most devastating of all is his Fujiwara Armbar, which has forced innumerable competitors into submission.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Alameda County, California, United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1655","wrestlerId":1655,"promotionId":65,"startDate":"2024-11-09T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":20500,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1296,1799,2331,2830,2831],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":41,"storytelling":56,"productFit":50,"riskTaking":44,"matchLayout":22,"psychology":58,"workerManagement":59,"trainingIntensity":44,"technicalCoaching":51,"characterCoaching":41,"teaching":59,"diagnosis":48,"rehabilitation":32,"prevention":31,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":22,"socialMediaSavvy":29,"ruleKnowledge":43,"positioning":27,"reactionSpeed":20,"consistency":56,"awareness":32,"judgement":63},"picture":"Timothy Thatcher_alt3.png"},{"id":1668,"name":"Malia Hosaka","realName":"Malia Hosaka","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"F","weight":130,"height":160,"dateOfBirth":"1969-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1987-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":4,"charisma":62,"micSkills":63,"condition":76,"hardcoreAbility":78,"injuryProne":81,"ability":52,"currentAbility":30,"potentialAbility":32,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Malia Hosaka was trained by Killer Kowalski at the wrestling training camp run by Misty Blue Simmes. In her debut match, Hosaka (wearing a Mary Lou Retton-inspired gymnastics outfit and billed as \"Malia Ho\") teamed with Simmes against Mad Dog Debbie Irons and Linda Dallas. Hosaka joined World Championship Wrestling in 1996 and competed in their newly formed women's division. She wrestled in the tournament to crown the first WCW Women's Champion, but was eliminated by Zero (Chigusa Nagayo). In 1999, Hosaka signed a developmental contract with World Wrestling Federation. WWF kept her under contract for a year, and shortly before her contract expired they considered bringing her to the main roster under the name \"Aphrodisia\" and pairing her with soon-to-be debuting talent Essa Rios. Instead, the role was given to Amy Dumas and the character was renamed \"Lita\". Hosaka was then released due to an internal lack of character idea development.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3235],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":73,"storytelling":75,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":25,"matchLayout":75,"psychology":73,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":54,"technicalCoaching":54,"characterCoaching":54,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":75,"mediaHandling":54,"brandBuilding":46,"socialMediaSavvy":43,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":54,"consistency":54,"awareness":73,"judgement":84},"picture":"Malia Hosaka.png"},{"id":1670,"name":"Demus","realName":"Demus","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":176,"height":157,"dateOfBirth":"1980-08-28T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1997-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":4166,"popularity":5,"charisma":62,"micSkills":73,"condition":84,"hardcoreAbility":42,"injuryProne":100,"ability":53,"currentAbility":42,"potentialAbility":44,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Pequeño Damián 666  is a Mexican professional wrestler. Pequeño Damián 666 is a part of Consejo Mundial de Lucha Libre's (CMLL) Mini-Estrella, or \"Mini\" division. Pequeño Damián 666 ring character is a Mini-version of wrestler Damián 666. In early June, 2010 he changed his ring name to Demus 3:16 as Damián 666 held the trademark to the name and would no longer allow him to use it.","alterEgos":["Demus 3:16"],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":63,"storytelling":66,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":40,"matchLayout":67,"psychology":63,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":70,"technicalCoaching":53,"characterCoaching":67,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":60,"mediaHandling":67,"brandBuilding":33,"socialMediaSavvy":73,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":70,"consistency":54,"awareness":63,"judgement":78},"picture":"Demus 666.png"},{"id":1671,"name":"Aéreo","realName":"Aéreo","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":11,"base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":130,"height":157,"dateOfBirth":"1990-09-05T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2005-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":32000,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":2,"charisma":34,"micSkills":36,"condition":86,"hardcoreAbility":62,"injuryProne":100,"ability":57,"currentAbility":54,"potentialAbility":60,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Víctor Gonzalo Barragán Hernández is a Mexican luchador, or professional wrestler currently working for the Mexican professional wrestling promotion Consejo Mundial de Lucha Libre (CMLL) in their Mini-Estrella division. Working in the Mini-Estrellas division does not necessarily mean that Aéreo is a dwarf as several wrestlers who are just shorter in stature work in the \"Mini\" division. Barragán works under the ring name Aéreo, Spanish for \"Air\".","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Mexico City, Mexico","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1671","wrestlerId":1671,"promotionId":11,"startDate":"2010-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":32000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":52,"storytelling":58,"productFit":59,"riskTaking":33,"matchLayout":60,"psychology":52,"workerManagement":59,"trainingIntensity":65,"technicalCoaching":53,"characterCoaching":46,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":67,"mediaHandling":46,"brandBuilding":23,"socialMediaSavvy":30,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":12,"reactionSpeed":65,"consistency":72,"awareness":52,"judgement":55},"picture":"Aereo.png"},{"id":1672,"name":"Marti Belle","realName":"Marti Belle","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":79,"base":"USA","gender":"F","weight":114,"height":160,"dateOfBirth":"1988-08-07T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":24600,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":8,"charisma":37,"micSkills":55,"condition":95,"hardcoreAbility":61,"injuryProne":100,"ability":54,"currentAbility":50,"potentialAbility":55,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Marti Belle is an American wrestler who works in America, Canada and the British Isles. She is a Very Small worker who is classed as using a Regular style. She is best known for her work with TNA, NXT, ROH, NWA, SHIMMER, EVOLVE, EVE and AIW.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2027-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1672","wrestlerId":1672,"promotionId":79,"startDate":"2025-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","wage":24600,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1112,2612,3333,3476,3477,3478,3479,4006],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":53,"storytelling":54,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":29,"matchLayout":55,"psychology":53,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":62,"technicalCoaching":42,"characterCoaching":63,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":71,"mediaHandling":63,"brandBuilding":57,"socialMediaSavvy":58,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":62,"consistency":69,"awareness":53,"judgement":72},"picture":"Marti Belle.png"},{"id":1674,"name":"Rayo de Jalisco Jr.","realName":"Rayo de Jalisco Jr.","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":258,"height":185,"dateOfBirth":"1960-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1975-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":8,"charisma":56,"micSkills":30,"condition":46,"hardcoreAbility":43,"injuryProne":81,"ability":44,"currentAbility":20,"potentialAbility":22,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Rayo de Jalisco Jr. is the ring name of a Mexican Luchador Enmascarado (masked professional wrestler) whose real name has not been revealed, per Lucha Libre traditions. Rayo de Jalisco, Jr. is the son of Rayo de Jalisco a famous wrestler from the early days of Lucha Libre; he also has a son who wrestles under the name Rayman. Rayo, Jr. is a former two time CMLL World Heavyweight Champion and the reigning WWA World Heavyweight Champion, a title he has held since March 21, 2003. Rayo de Jalisco, Jr.'s real name is not a matter of public record, as is often the case with masked wrestlers in Mexico where their private lives are kept a secret from the wrestling fans.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":62,"storytelling":64,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":53,"matchLayout":64,"psychology":62,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":36,"technicalCoaching":41,"characterCoaching":46,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":47,"mediaHandling":46,"brandBuilding":46,"socialMediaSavvy":33,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":36,"consistency":42,"awareness":62,"judgement":77},"picture":"Rayo de Jalisco.png"},{"id":1675,"name":"Rayman","realName":"Rayman","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":189,"height":167,"dateOfBirth":"1978-10-25T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1999-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":2,"charisma":63,"micSkills":39,"condition":93,"hardcoreAbility":51,"injuryProne":100,"ability":44,"currentAbility":33,"potentialAbility":35,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"First came to peoples attention in Mexico City as an undercard wrestler named Rayman. Was revealed to be the son of Rayo de Jalisco Jr. and given the El Hijo del Rayo de Jalisco Jr. character in 2001, pushed as a new young star and teaming with the likes of El Hijo del Santo and Negro Casas. Allegedly, his father soon grew jealous when promoters started to book his son instead of him, and the two had some falling out. El Hijo del Rayo de Jalisco Jr. switched to the identity Hombre Sin Nombre character for a time, then switched back to being called Rayman, but lost the moment he had as Rayo de Jalisco and was never a top star again.","alterEgos":["Hijo del Rayo de Jalisco Jr."],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":44,"storytelling":54,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":33,"matchLayout":57,"psychology":44,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":73,"technicalCoaching":54,"characterCoaching":44,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":67,"mediaHandling":44,"brandBuilding":53,"socialMediaSavvy":38,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":73,"consistency":60,"awareness":44,"judgement":66},"picture":"RayMan.png"},{"id":1676,"name":"James Maritato","realName":"James Maritato","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Europe","gender":"M","weight":169,"height":165,"dateOfBirth":"1972-03-12T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1991-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":8,"charisma":50,"micSkills":49,"condition":74,"hardcoreAbility":75,"injuryProne":100,"ability":50,"currentAbility":32,"potentialAbility":74,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"James Maritato is an American professional wrestler, of Italian origin, currently working on the independent circuit. He is best known for his work in World Wrestling Entertainment (WWE) and Extreme Championship Wrestling (ECW) under the ring names Little Guido Maritato and Nunzio. In 1992 he joined Extreme Championship Wrestling (ECW) under the name Damian Stone. He was later given the gimmick of Little Guido and put in the comedy stable the Full Blooded Italians (F.B.I.), alongside an African American named \"The Italian Stallion\" J.T. Smith, Tracy Smothers, and \"The Big Don\" Tommy Rich. None of whom, with the exception of Maritato, were really of Italian descent. He is also known to have played the role of female wrestler Raisha Saeed on at least 2 ocassions, both times the woman who normally donned the gimmick was in the match as his opponent (Cheerleader Melissa)","alterEgos":["Little Guido","Damian Stone","Tony Broadway","Nunzio"],"birthplace":"Italy","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[496,3184,3185,3709],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":68,"storytelling":73,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":16,"matchLayout":75,"psychology":68,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":55,"technicalCoaching":55,"characterCoaching":70,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":84,"mediaHandling":70,"brandBuilding":35,"socialMediaSavvy":58,"ruleKnowledge":61,"positioning":69,"reactionSpeed":55,"consistency":58,"awareness":68,"judgement":81},"picture":"Little Guido_alt1.png"},{"id":1677,"name":"Moose","realName":"Moose","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":28,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":299,"height":193,"dateOfBirth":"1984-04-23T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2014-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":30700,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":29,"charisma":87,"micSkills":83,"condition":84,"hardcoreAbility":90,"injuryProne":100,"ability":64,"currentAbility":64,"potentialAbility":77,"morale":"poor","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"powerhouse","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Moose’s six years as an offensive lineman playing for the NFL prepared him to become a stand-out in the world of professional wrestling. A two-time IMPACT Grand Champion, Moose is easily one of IMPACT’s most hard hitting competitors. With a passion for athletics and knowledge in the industry, Moose is able to set himself apart from the rest.\r\n\r\nMoose continues to re-invent himself and is a fixture in the main event picture. What does the future hold for Mr. IMPACT Wrestling?","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Seabrook, Maryland, United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1677","wrestlerId":1677,"promotionId":28,"startDate":"2016-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":30700,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3811],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":60,"storytelling":62,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":63,"psychology":60,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":71,"technicalCoaching":42,"characterCoaching":60,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":73,"mediaHandling":60,"brandBuilding":78,"socialMediaSavvy":62,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":71,"consistency":70,"awareness":60,"judgement":76},"picture":"Moose.png"},{"id":1678,"name":"Chase Owens","realName":"Chase Owens","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":38,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":205,"height":182,"dateOfBirth":"1990-03-07T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2007-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":40000,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":13,"charisma":64,"micSkills":48,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":65,"injuryProne":100,"ability":42,"currentAbility":40,"potentialAbility":46,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"reti