ore becoming Máscara Sagrada in 1989. He split from CMLL to join AAA in 1992, before returning to CMLL after a dispute with Antonio Pena in 1997. He went back and forth between the two companies and is currently working in AAA on a temporary basis.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":74,"storytelling":76,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":17,"matchLayout":76,"psychology":74,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":47,"technicalCoaching":54,"characterCoaching":44,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":83,"mediaHandling":44,"brandBuilding":53,"socialMediaSavvy":38,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":47,"consistency":46,"awareness":74,"judgement":84},"picture":"Mascara Sagrada.png"},{"id":1683,"name":"El Hijo de Máscara Sagrada","realName":"El Hijo de Máscara Sagrada","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":181,"height":187,"dateOfBirth":"1990-05-04T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":2,"charisma":23,"micSkills":41,"condition":91,"hardcoreAbility":19,"injuryProne":90,"ability":30,"currentAbility":29,"potentialAbility":35,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Son of the original Mascara Sagrada. His brother currently wrestles as Máscara Sagrada Jr., not to be mistaken by the AAA created Máscara Sagrada Jr. who has no family relationship. Pushed as one of the top stars in the Juniors promotion in 2011. Has made scattered appearances in IWRG.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes"