y and a road agent. He had regular tag teams with Zak Knight (Knight Dynasty) and Roy Knight (Knight Family). He is married to Saraya Knight.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"England","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3276,3277],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":62,"storytelling":70,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":74,"matchLayout":73,"psychology":62,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":33,"technicalCoaching":17,"characterCoaching":49,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":26,"mediaHandling":49,"brandBuilding":27,"socialMediaSavvy":39,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":33,"consistency":15,"awareness":62,"judgement":77},"picture":"Ricky Knight.png"},{"id":1704,"name":"La Parkita","realName":"La Parkita","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":136,"height":144,"dateOfBirth":"1972-04-23T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1991-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":2,"charisma":31,"micSkills":41,"condition":65,"hardcoreAbility":42,"injuryProne":80,"ability":38,"currentAbility":24,"potentialAbility":26,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"La Parkita is a Mexican Luchador enmascarado who works in the Mini-Estrella division for Asistencia Asesoría y Administración. He is the third wrestler to compete as La Parkita and is at times denoted as \"La Parkita III\" or \"La Parkita (AAA)\". La Parkita's real name is not a matter of public record, as is often the case with masked wrestlers in Mexico where their private lives are kept a secret from the wrestling fans. Working in the Mini division does not automatically mean that he has dwarfism as several short wrestlers work in the \"Mini\" division.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":54,"storytelling":61,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":58,"matchLayout":63,"psychology":54,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":56,"technicalCoaching":42,"characterCoaching":58,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":42,"mediaHandling":58,"brandBuilding":20,"socialMediaSavvy":36,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":56,"consistency":37,"awareness":54,"judgement":72},"picture":"La Parkita.png"},{"id":1705,"name":"Mascarita Divina","realName":"Mascarita Divina","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":110,"height":139,"dateOfBirth":"1988-12-21T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2007-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":2,"charisma":49,"micSkills":56,"condition":88,"hardcoreAbility":51,"injuryProne":100,"ability":52,"currentAbility":48,"potentialAbility":53,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Mascarita Divina is the ring name of a Mexican Luchador enmascarado, or masked professional wrestler. Divina works for Asistencia Asesoría y Administración in their Mini-Estrella division. Mascarita Divina's name is Spanish for \"Little Divine Mask\", taken after the name of the regular sized Máscara Divina who he's a mascota version off. Mascarita Divina's real name is not a matter of public record, as is often the case with masked wrestlers in Mexico where their private lives are kept a secret from the wrestling fans. Working in the Mini division does not automatically mean that he has dwarfism as several short wrestlers work in the \"Mini\" division.","alterEgos":["Mini Drago"],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":44,"storytelling":55,"productFit":70,"riskTaking":40,"matchLayout":58,"psychology":44,"workerManagement":70,"trainingIntensity":76,"technicalCoaching":37,"characterCoaching":56,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":60,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":14,"socialMediaSavvy":56,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":14,"reactionSpeed":76,"consistency":74,"awareness":44,"judgement":54},"picture":"Mascarita Divina.png"},{"id":1706,"name":"Tiago","realName":"Tiago","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":143,"height":157,"dateOfBirth":"1987-07-09T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2004-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":48,"micSkills":37,"condition":87,"hardcoreAbility":33,"injuryProne":100,"ability":42,"currentAbility":38,"potentialAbility":42,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Arturo Santos Hernandez is a Mexican Luchador or professional wrestler, better known by his ring name Mini Charly Manson. He works in the Mini-Estrella division for Asistencia Asesoría y Administración (AAA), and was the first holder of the AAA World Mini-Estrella Championship. Not to be confused Charly Manson Jr. who sometimes works under the name Mini Charly Manson.","alterEgos":["Mini Charly Manson"],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":46,"storytelling":53,"productFit":60,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":55,"psychology":46,"workerManagement":60,"trainingIntensity":83,"technicalCoaching":34,"characterCoaching":71,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":63,"medi