","autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3549,4280],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":77,"storytelling":77,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":16,"matchLayout":77,"psychology":77,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":82,"technicalCoaching":64,"characterCoaching":82,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":84,"mediaHandling":82,"brandBuilding":77,"socialMediaSavvy":85,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":82,"consistency":79,"awareness":77,"judgement":86},"picture":"Toni Storm_alt16.png"},{"id":1717,"name":"Thomas Kearins","realName":"Thomas Kearins","nickname":"","type":"referee","base":"UK","gender":"M","weight":206,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1995-01-17T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2010-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":66000,"popularity":0,"charisma":56,"micSkills":66,"condition":98,"hardcoreAbility":65,"injuryProne":100,"ability":45,"currentAbility":45,"potentialAbility":53,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"ICW's Senior Official, Kearins is also a trained wrestler, something not many fans are aware of, or even many of his peers. Other members of the locker room should perhaps keep that in mind – this is one referee who isn't scared to assert his authority. There is nobody more trusted to officiate the big matches in ICW than Thomas Kearins, and for good reason, he can be depended on by ICW management to make the big calls.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Scotland","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":0,"storytelling":0,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":100,"matchLayout":0,"psychology":0,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":0,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":39,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":0,"mediaHandling":39,"brandBuilding":0,"socialMediaSavvy":24,"ruleKnowledge":53,"positioning":42,"reactionSpeed":0,"consistency":0,"awareness":0,"judgement":0},"picture":"Thomas Kearins.png"},{"id":1718,"name":"Brandi Rhodes","realName":"Brandi Rhodes","nickname":"","type":"manager","base":"USA","gender":"F","weight":154,"height":165,"dateOfBirth":"1983-06-23T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2011-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":66000,"popularity":15,"charisma":59,"micSkills":49,"condition":97,"hardcoreAbility":28,"injuryProne":100,"ability":37,"currentAbility":31,"potentialAbility":31,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"When Brandi Rhodes came to Ring of Honor, many wrestling fans recognized her as the beautiful wife of Cody and a former ring announcer for WWE, but she’s certainly not an arm piece or background player. No longer entering the ring in an elegant dress with a microphone in hand, Brandi now comes dressed for battle in tights and wrestling boots, and she is determined to become a major player with Women of Honor. It was apparent from her very first matches with WOH that Brandi is not just another pretty face.\r\n\r\nInstead of using her immediate connections to ensure big paydays and high-profile matches, Brandi joined WOH in earnest. Her journey is one to watch as she gains experience and hones her talents inside the ring.","alterEgos":["Eden"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2696],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":33,"storytelling":40,"productFit":5,"riskTaking":45,"matchLayout":43,"psychology":33,"workerManagement":5,"trainingIntensity":53,"technica