at a very young age. Starting in 1995 Taniguchi started wrestling occasionally in Big Japan Pro Wrestling, finally joining the promotion as a full time member in 2006.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Japan","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":61,"storytelling":66,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":31,"matchLayout":68,"psychology":61,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":65,"technicalCoaching":53,"characterCoaching":30,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":69,"mediaHandling":30,"brandBuilding":31,"socialMediaSavvy":49,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":65,"consistency":58,"awareness":61,"judgement":77},"picture":"Yuichi Taniguchi.png"},{"id":1729,"name":"Toshiyuki Sakuda","realName":"Toshiyuki Sakuda","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Japan","gender":"M","weight":180,"height":152,"dateOfBirth":"1991-08-25T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2014-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":4166,"popularity":3,"charisma":62,"micSkills":74,"condition":84,"hardcoreAbility":70,"injuryProne":100,"ability":68,"currentAbility":66,"potentialAbility":72,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"hardcore","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Toshiyuki Sakuda is a Japanese wrestler who works in the USA and Japan. He is a 5'1\", 180lb worker who is classed as using a Psychopath style. He uses the Moonsault as his finisher. He is best known for his work with NOAH, AJPW, BJW, GCW and FREEDOMS. Outside of wrestling he is a former MMA fighter.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Japan","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":54,"storytelling":59,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":44,"matchLayout":61,"psy