ks in the USA, the British Isles, Japan and Europe. She is a 5'5\", 110lb worker who is classed as using a Technician style. She uses the Diving Double Foot Stomp, the Dragon Suplex and the Frog Splash as her finishers. She is best known for her work with Stardom, Marigold, ROH, Sendai Girls, ZERO1, Ice Ribbon, Lucha Ungrnd, WRESTLE-1 and Marvelous. She is the protege of Fuka.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Japan","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1533,2446,2793,2794,3353,3610,3978],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":88,"storytelling":88,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":18,"matchLayout":88,"psychology":88,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":87,"technicalCoaching":85,"characterCoaching":78,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":82,"mediaHandling":78,"brandBuilding":80,"socialMediaSavvy":63,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":87,"consistency":84,"awareness":88,"judgement":93},"picture":"Mayu Iwatani_alt5.png"},{"id":1795,"name":"Momo Watanabe","realName":"Momo Watanabe","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":61,"base":"Japan","gender":"F","weight":143,"height":152,"dateOfBirth":"2000-03-22T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2014-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":30700,"wageType":"monthly","popularity":17,"charisma":56,"micSkills":54,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":68,"injuryProne":100,"ability":64,"currentAbility":62,"potentialAbility":73,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"submission","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Momo Watanabe, who graduated from Stardom Dojo on 01 November 2014, is a Japanese wrestler who works exclusively in Japan. She is a 5'1\", 143lb worker who is classed as using a Impactful style. She uses the Dropkick and the Somato as her finishers. She is best known for 