ively in Mexico. He is a Small worker who is classed as using a Luchador style. He is best known for his work with CMLL. He is engaged to someone outside the wrestling business.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1915","wrestlerId":1915,"promotionId":11,"startDate":"2009-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":32000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":58,"storytelling":63,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":25,"matchLayout":65,"psychology":58,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":63,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":42,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":75,"mediaHandling":42,"brandBuilding":30,"socialMediaSavvy":28,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":63,"consistency":62,"awareness":58,"judgement":75},"picture":"Astral.png"},{"id":1916,"name":"Pequeño Olímpico","realName":"Pequeño Olímpico","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":11,"base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":130,"height":157,"dateOfBirth":"1966-02-04T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1992-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":32000,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":2,"charisma":53,"micSkills":43,"condition":76,"hardcoreAbility":64,"injuryProne":100,"ability":64,"currentAbility":33,"potentialAbility":35,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Pequeño Olímpico is a Mexican luchador enmascarado, or masked professional wrestler. Pequeño Olímpico is a part of Consejo Mundial de Lucha Libre's (CMLL) Mini-Estrella division and holds the record for the longest CMLL World Mini-Estrella Championship reign, with 1,442 days. He has held the title twice. Pequeño Olímpico is Spanish for \"Little Olympian\", alluding to the fact that he wrestles as a mini version of Olímpico. He previously worked as Cicloncito Ramírez, a mini version of Ciclón Ramirez.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1916","wrestlerId":1916,"promotionId":11,"startDate":"1992-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":32000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":53,"storytelling":62,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":31,"matchLayout":65,"psychology":53,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":59,"technicalCoaching":60,"characterCoaching":38,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":69,"mediaHandling":38,"brandBuilding":19,"socialMediaSavvy":46,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":59,"consistency":58,"awareness":53,"judgement":72},"picture":"Pequeno Olimpico.png"},{"id":1918,"name":"Acero","realName":"Acero","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":11,"base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":132,"height":157,"dateOfBirth":"1984-08-04T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":32000,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":2,"charisma":58,"micSkills":47,"condition":86,"hardcoreAbility":44,"injuryProne":87,"ability":48,"currentAbility":41,"potentialAbility":44,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Acero is a Mexican luchador enmascarado, or masked professional wrestler currently working for the Mexican professional wrestling promotion Consejo Mundial de Lucha Libre (CMLL) in their Mini-Estrella division. Working in the Mini-Estrellas division does not necessarily mean that Acero is a dwarf as several wrestlers who are just shorter in stature work in the \"Mini\" division. Acero is Spanish for \"Steel\" and is a shortened version of his previous ring name Niño de Acero or \"Boy of Steel\". Acero's real name is not a matter of public record, as is often the case with masked wrestlers in Mexico where their private lives are kept a secret from the wrestling fans.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Ciudad Nezahualcoyotl, State of Mexico, Mexico","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1918","wrestlerId":1918,"promotionId":11,"startDate":"2012-03-04T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":32000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":51,"storytelling":57,"productFit":75,"riskTaking":35,"matchLayout":59,"psychology":51,"workerManagement":75,"trainingIntensity":62,"technicalCoaching":49,"characterCoaching":41,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":65,"mediaHandling":41,"brandBuilding":30,"socialMediaSavvy":23,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":15,"reactionSpeed":62,"consistency":60,"awareness":51,"judgement":61},"picture":"Acero.png"},{"id":1919,"name":"Último Dragoncito","realName":"Último Dragoncito","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":11,"base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":161,"height":154,"dateOfBirth":"1972-08-08T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1991-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":32000,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":2,"charisma":66,"micSkills":47,"condition":63,"hardcoreAbility":61,"injuryProne":77,"ability":71,"currentAbility":45,"