yle. He uses the Shooting Star Knee Drop as their finisher. He is best known for their work with AEW, TNA, AAA, DDT, PWG, wXw, RevPro, GCW, GWF, DPW, EVOLVE, Beyond, REVOLVER, OTT, FCP, BLP, Smash, C4, ATTACK!, Riptide, Defiant, A1, CZW and SWE. He is married to Veda Scott. He was voted Male Independent Wrestler Of The Year in 2022.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Canada","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1938","wrestlerId":1938,"promotionId":76,"startDate":"2025-02-22T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":40000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[586,587,1781,2199,2225,2231,2282,3855,3929,4185],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":62,"storytelling":68,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":23,"matchLayout":70,"psychology":62,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":88,"technicalCoaching":63,"characterCoaching":56,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":77,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":40,"socialMediaSavvy":45,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":88,"consistency":81,"awareness":62,"judgement":77},"picture":"Mike Bailey.png"},{"id":1939,"name":"William Eaver","realName":"William Eaver","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"UK","gender":"M","weight":200,"height":177,"dateOfBirth":"1988-08-22T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2013-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":2,"charisma":59,"micSkills":52,"condition":96,"hardcoreAbility":57,"injuryProne":80,"ability":51,"currentAbility":47,"potentialAbility":47,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"William Eaver is a British professional wrestler. He got involved in wrestling training when he came across a promotion in London called Progress, and noticed they had a training facility, The Projo in Camberwell South London. He turned up there one Saturday morning for a session with, a man who (he claims) has since been possessed by darkness, Mr Jimmy Havoc who tested him and the other students there to their limits. He truly is a BillEaver (had to be added).","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"England","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3438],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":44,"storytelling":51,"productFit":30,"riskTaking":39,"matchLayout":54,"psychology":44,"workerManagement":30,"trainingIntensity":70,"technicalCoaching":46,"characterCoaching":63,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":61,"mediaHandling":63,"brandBuilding":40,"socialMediaSavvy":61,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":6,"reactionSpeed":70,"consistency":65,"awareness":44,"judgement":38},"picture":"William Eaver.png"},{"id":1940,"name":"Toshiaki Kawada","realName":"Toshiaki Kawada","nickname":"","type":"writer","base":"Japan","gender":"M","weight":231,"height":180,"dateOfBirth":"1963-12-08T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1982-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":66000,"popularity":8,"charisma":100,"micSkills":100,"condition":64,"hardcoreAbility":78,"injuryProne":77,"ability":99,"currentAbility":48,"potentialAbility":48,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Toshiaki Kawada is a Japanese semi-retired professional wrestler who is most known for his work in All Japan Pro Wrestling (AJPW). In 2005, he started freelancing in other promotions. His matches against Mitsuharu Misawa, Jun Akiyama, and Kenta Kobashi in the 1990s are argued by many fans and experts in the industry as some of the greatest professional wrestling matches of all time. He is widely known for his extremely stiff wrestling style, martial arts strikes and has the distinction of having competed in 19 matches that were given a 5-Star Rating by Wrestling Observer Newsletter writer Dave Meltzer. Although Kawada has not announced a formal retirement, he admitted that the death of his rival Misawa in 2009 diminished his passion for the business.","alterEgos":["Mr. Toshiaki"],"birthplace":"Japan","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1097,3253],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":96,"storytelling":97,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":98,"psychology":96,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":49,"technicalCoaching":54,"characterCoaching":58,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":63,"mediaHandling":58,"brandBuilding":63,"socialMediaSavvy":40,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":49,"consistency":42,"awareness":96,"judgement":98},"picture":"Toshiaki Kawada.png"},{"id":1941,"name":"Chad Gable","realName":"Chad Gable","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":64,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":202,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1986-03-08T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2003-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":75000,"wageType":"monthly","popularity":53,"charisma":75,"micSkills":93,"condition":80,"hardcoreAbility":92,"injuryProne":100,"ability":84,"currentAbility":84,"potentialAbility":88,"morale":"good","presentation":"face","prestige":"mid","style":"technical","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Chad Gable exudes the competitiveness, intensity and confidence of an Olympic athlete for good reason: He was one.\r\n\r\nHailing from Minnesota, a state rich in wrestling history, Gable has been a master of the mat since his youth. A former state champion in high school, he reached the pinnacle of amateur grappling in 2012, claiming victory in the U.S. Olympic Trials and earning the right to compete at the London Olympics that summer. Once the Summer Games passed, Gable turned his focus to sports-entertainment, signing on to train at the WWE Performance Center.\r\n\r\nIt wasn’t long before Gable's prodigious skill inside the ring propelled him to Superstardom in NXT, where the savant of suplexes found his greatest success teaming with fellow amateur standout Jason Jordan. Known as American Alpha, the duo ignited NXT’s tandem division and won over the NXT Universe before being drafted to SmackDown LIVE in 2016 and eventually winning the SmackDown Tag Team Championship.","alterEgos":["Chas Betts","Original El Grande Americano"],"birthplace":"Minneapolis, Minnesota, United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1941","wrestlerId":1941,"promotionId":64,"startDate":"2018-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":75000,"wageType":"monthly","type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[927,928,1671,1845,2342],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":74,"storytelling":78,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":23,"matchLayout":79,"psychology":74,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":88,"technicalCoaching":84,"characterCoaching":76,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":77,"mediaHandling":76,"brandBuilding":66,"socialMediaSavvy":71,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":88,"consistency":83,"awareness":74,"judgement":84},"picture":"Chad Gable.png"},{"id":1945,"name":"Adam Thornstowe","realName":"Adam Thornstowe","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":216,"height":172,"dateOfBirth":"1983-01-19T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2001-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","w