v Sihra","realName":"Harv Sihra","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Canada","gender":"M","weight":174,"height":172,"dateOfBirth":"1987-11-02T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2005-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":4166,"popularity":16,"charisma":44,"micSkills":64,"condition":85,"hardcoreAbility":74,"injuryProne":100,"ability":49,"currentAbility":44,"potentialAbility":58,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"The Bollywood Boyz, Gurv and Harv Sihra, have used unwavering passion and old fashioned work ethic to climb their way to their current position. lthough they are of Indian descent, their humble beginnings in pro wrestling took place in Canada, where they endured agonizingly long drives and dangerously cold temperatures on what came to be known as “Northern Hell Death Tours” in chase of their dream. That journey also brought them before some of the most knowledgeable wrestling minds in the world today, as the two have sought out training with the likes of The Hart Family, Harley Race, Rip Rogers & Danny Davis.","alterEgos":["Samir Singh"],"birthplace":"Canada","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[635,953,954,3390],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":54,"storytelling":61,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":30,"matchLayout":64,"psychology":54,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":79,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":69,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":70,"mediaHandling":69,"brandBuilding":37,"socialMediaSavvy":44,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":79,"consistency":58,"awareness":54,"judgement":72},"picture":"Harv Sihra_alt2.png"},{"id":2001,"name":"Gurv Sihra","realName":"Gurv Sihra","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Canada","gen