ted monumental victories over the likes of Finn Bálor and John Cena.\r\n\r\nLong the object of disdain and mockery from the WWE Universe, Elias was suddenly showered in cheers thanks to a cathartic swing of his guitar. When Acting Raw GM Baron Corbin dared to order Elias off the stage during an impromptu post-victory concert, the crooning Superstar momentarily acquiesced, emerged moments later and walloped The Lone Wolf in the back with his trusty instrument. The attack drew raucous applause from the WWE Universe, who suddenly","alterEgos":["Logan Shulo","Ezekiel","Elias"],"birthplace":"Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2027-02-20T00:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2036","wrestlerId":2036,"promotionId":28,"startDate":"2025-02-20T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-02-20T00:00:00.000Z","wage":41000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2337],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":58,"storytelling":61,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":30,"matchLayout":62,"psychology":58,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":72,"technicalCoaching":43,"characterCoaching":82,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":70,"mediaHandling":82,"brandBuilding":75,"socialMediaSavvy":77,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":72,"consistency":68,"awareness":58,"judgement":75},"picture":"Elijah.png"},{"id":2037,"name":"Oki Okidata","realName":"Oki Okidata","nickname":"","type":"manager","base":"Japan","gender":"M","weight":174,"height":162,"dateOfBirth":"1973-09-09T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2002-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":66000,"popularity":2,"charisma":42,"micSkills":23,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":45,"injuryProne":0,"ability":38,"currentAbility":25,"potentialAbility":27,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","car