tting a ruthless post-match attack on Mia Yim and Kayden Carter, quickly turning heads.\r\n\r\nThough new to NXT, Green is far from untested, having honed her craft winning championships elsewhere and competing on Tough Enough before arriving at the WWE Performance Center. The British Columbia native is a graduate of Lance Storm’s Storm Wrestling Academy in Calgary, where she learned to harness the athleticism that made her a standout in soccer, volleyball, basketball and track.","alterEgos":["Laurel Van Ness"],"birthplace":"Victoria, British Columbia, Canada","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2134","wrestlerId":2134,"promotionId":64,"startDate":"2023-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":50000,"wageType":"monthly","type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1644,1947,3388,3582,3785,3995],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":56,"storytelling":59,"productFit":89,"riskTaking":24,"matchLayout":60,"psychology":56,"workerManagement":89,"trainingIntensity":65,"technicalCoaching":40,"characterCoaching":82,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":76,"mediaHandling":82,"brandBuilding":73,"socialMediaSavvy":79,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":18,"reactionSpeed":65,"consistency":70,"awareness":56,"judgement":69},"picture":"Chelsea Green.png","injury":{"type":"Broken Nose","daysToRecover":1},"returnDate":"2026-04-13T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":2135,"name":"Alessandro Del Bruno","realName":"Alessandro Del Bruno","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Canada","gender":"M","weight":165,"height":175,"dateOfBirth":"1989-02-24T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2005-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":65,"micSkills":58,"condition":94,"hardcoreAbility":44,"injuryProne":100,"ability":61,"currentAbility":57,"potentialAbility":62,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","p