e footsteps of his grandfather, father and uncles, Carrillo began competing in his native Mexico while still a teenager. With an awe-inspiring collection of aerial attacks to his name, the speedster soon found success at home and abroad, most notably on tours in Japan, before being recruited into the WWE Performance Center in 2018.\r\n\r\nCarrillo made an indelible impression on the WWE Universe immediately after joining the rosters of NXT and 205 Live. Now on Raw as a result of the 2019 WWE Draft, Carrillo has made an immediate impact by mixing it up with the likes of Seth Rollins and AJ Styles.","alterEgos":["Humberto Carrillo","Ultimo Ninja"],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2143","wrestlerId":2143,"promotionId":5,"startDate":"2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":41000,"wageType":"monthly","type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1831,2365,2785,3878],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":54,"storytelling":60,"productFit":88,"riskTaking":33,"matchLayout":62,"psychology":54,"workerManagement":88,"trainingIntensity":80,"technicalCoaching":59,"characterCoaching":45,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":67,"mediaHandling":45,"brandBuilding":61,"socialMediaSavvy":38,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":18,"reactionSpeed":80,"consistency":56,"awareness":54,"judgement":68},"picture":"Berto.png"},{"id":2147,"name":"Tony Givens","realName":"Tony Givens","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":196,"height":180,"dateOfBirth":"1982-08-07T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2000-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":49,"micSkills":37,"condition":97,"hardcoreAbility":31,"injuryProne":100,"ability":52,"currentAbility":43,"potentialAbility":43,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style