t known for his work with wXw.","alterEgos":["Vinny Vortex"],"birthplace":"Turkey","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1070],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":52,"storytelling":57,"productFit":39,"riskTaking":40,"matchLayout":58,"psychology":52,"workerManagement":39,"trainingIntensity":56,"technicalCoaching":47,"characterCoaching":56,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":60,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":55,"socialMediaSavvy":49,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":8,"reactionSpeed":56,"consistency":51,"awareness":52,"judgement":47},"picture":"Vincent The Beast.png"},{"id":2198,"name":"Axel Tischer","realName":"Axel Tischer","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Europe","gender":"M","weight":209,"height":185,"dateOfBirth":"1986-11-05T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2004-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":4166,"popularity":20,"charisma":60,"micSkills":55,"condition":89,"hardcoreAbility":86,"injuryProne":100,"ability":69,"currentAbility":61,"potentialAbility":75,"morale":"poor","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"striker","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"strike","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Unhinged and unpredictable, the vicious Alexander Wolfe looks to make NXT UK his own as part of Imperium. Just like his cohorts, Wolfe enjoys nothing more than roughing up whomever is deemed an enemy. First making a name for himself as a member of the unorthodox group SAnitY alongside Eric Young, Killian Dain and Nikki Cross, Wolfe made a surprise emergence on NXT UK to help give WWE UK Champion WALTER, Marcel Barthel and Fabian Aichner a controversial victory over British Strong Style. He officially joined the “Absolute Power” faction the following week to complete the intimidating alliance. Together, Imperium hold the belief that the mat is sacred, a mantra that they will preach as they set out to take the rising brand by storm. That is a mission well-suited to Alexander Wolfe.","alterEgos":["Alexander Wolfe"],"birthplace":"Turkey","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1251,1307,3943,3944],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":68,"storytelling":73,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":17,"matchLayout":74,"psychology":68,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":76,"technicalCoaching":61,"characterCoaching":58,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":83,"mediaHandling":58,"brandBuilding":49,"socialMediaSavvy":63,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":76,"consistency":76,"awareness":68,"judgement":81},"picture":"Axel Tischer_alt4.png"},{"id":2199,"name":"Cathy Kelley","realName":"Cathy Kelley","nickname":"","type":"interviewer","promotionId":64,"base":"USA","gender":"F","weight":125,"height":167,"dateOfBirth":"1988-09-11T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2016-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":50000,"wageType":"monthly","popularity":30,"charisma":50,"micSkills":44,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":58,"injuryProne":100,"ability":42,"currentAbility":39,"potentialAbility":44,"morale":"poor","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Cathy Kelley may have joined WWE in 2016, but this Mensa International–certified journalist, podcaster and red carpet interviewer has been a passionate member of the WWE Universe for years. As a longtime fan of the squared circle, Cathy gained notice among the WWE Universe as a host of AfterBuzz’s weekly recap programs for Monday Night Raw and WWE NXT. The Illinois native later debuted with WWE as WWE.com’s digital correspondent during WrestleMania 32 Week in Dallas.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Oak Park, Illinois, United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2199","wrestlerId":2199,"promotionId":64,"startDate":"2022-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":50000,"wageType":"monthly","type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":53,"storytelling":42,"productFit":49,"riskTaking":26,"matchLayout":53,"psychology":29,"workerManagement":20,"trainingIntensity":21,"technicalCoaching":24,"characterCoaching":45,"teaching":44,"diagnosis":54,"rehabilitation":44,"prevention":24,"mediaHandling":69,"brandBuilding":78,"socialMediaSavvy":43,"ruleKnowledge":50,"positioning":33,"reactionSpeed":27,"consistency":37,"awareness":60,"judgement":36},"picture":"Cathy Kelley.png"},{"id":2204,"name":"Livvii Grace","realName":"Livvii Grace","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"UK","gender":"F","weight":143,"height":165,"dateOfBirth":"1993-04-10T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2014-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":0,"charisma":48,"micSkills":25,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":28,"injuryProne":93,"ability":40,"currentAbility":40,"potentialAbility":47,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Livvii Grace (F.K.A. Tennessee Honey) is an English wrestler who works exclusively in the British Isles. She is a Small worker who is classed as using a Regular Wrestler style.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"England","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":34,"storytelling":40,"productFit":26,"riskTaking":39,"matchLayout":42,"psychology":34,"workerManagement":26,"trainingIntensity":61,"technicalCoaching":22,"characterCoaching":53,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":61,"mediaHandling":53,"brandBuilding":44,"socialMediaSavvy":34,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":5,"reactionSpeed":61,"consistency":48,"awareness":34,"judgement":31},"picture":"Livvii Grace.png"},{"id":2205,"name":"Xia Brookside","realName":"Xia Brookside","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":28,"base":"UK","gender":"F","weight":110,"height":157,"dateOfBirth":"1998-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2015-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":20500,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":14,"charisma":40,"micSkills":53,"condition":98,"hardcoreAbility":42,"injuryProne":87,"ability":59,"currentAbility":59,"potentialAbility":89,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"It’s sometimes easy to forget Xia Brookside is as young as she is, as she enters the world of NXT UK already a well-traveled champion, having battled in five countries and 10 states just a few years into her career. She also boasts an impressive pedigree as the daughter of British wrestling legend and WWE Performance Center coach Robbie Brookside.\r\n\r\nStill just getting started in NXT UK, Brookside has already established a rivalry with Nina Samuels and tangled with the likes of Kay Lee Ray, Isla Dawn and Jinny.\r\n\r\nThe spunky youngster has won the hearts of young sports-entertainment fans with her bubbly, upbeat personality, but she’s a self-described “firecracker” who can throw haymakers with the best of them. Those unlucky enough to face the youthful ball of energy will be in dire straits when Brookside nearly drives them through the canvas with her ring-rattling Brooksy Bomb.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Leicester, England","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","