 in Japan. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Japanese Junior style. Tamura is a product of the U-file Dojo and the main wrestler of E-Style. Tamura is mainly involved in small shoot-style indy promotions and he also worked in IGF in 2008. After winning a mid-carder recruiting match at the end of 2008, Tamura started to also wrestle in DDT.","alterEgos":["TAMURA"],"birthplace":"Japan","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":58,"storytelling":65,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":20,"matchLayout":67,"psychology":58,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":76,"technicalCoaching":79,"characterCoaching":45,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":80,"mediaHandling":45,"brandBuilding":43,"socialMediaSavvy":34,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":76,"consistency":67,"awareness":58,"judgement":75},"picture":"Kazuhiro Tamura.png"},{"id":2255,"name":"Big Mike","realName":"Big Mike","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":197,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1990-08-12T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2007-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":3000,"popularity":2,"charisma":46,"micSkills":37,"condition":92,"hardcoreAbility":52,"injuryProne":100,"ability":55,"currentAbility":53,"potentialAbility":59,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Big Mike is a Mexican luchador who works exclusively in Mexico. He is a 5'8\", 197lb worker who is classed as using a Luchador style. He is best known for his work with IWRG.","alterEgos":["Mr. Mike"],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":51,"storyt