nd NLL. He is currently a TNT Tag Team champion and a NWA World Tag Team champion.","alterEgos":["Mr. 450"],"birthplace":"Mayagüez, Puerto Rico","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2290","wrestlerId":2290,"promotionId":5,"startDate":"2022-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":30700,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2177,3077,3564],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":57,"storytelling":62,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":32,"matchLayout":63,"psychology":57,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":74,"technicalCoaching":55,"characterCoaching":63,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":68,"mediaHandling":63,"brandBuilding":55,"socialMediaSavvy":57,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":74,"consistency":52,"awareness":57,"judgement":74},"picture":"Mecha Wolf.png"},{"id":2291,"name":"Anthony Bennett","realName":"Anthony Bennett","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":165,"height":177,"dateOfBirth":"1995-11-21T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2012-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":62,"micSkills":56,"condition":96,"hardcoreAbility":43,"injuryProne":99,"ability":52,"currentAbility":52,"potentialAbility":60,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"The first thing you’ll notice about Anthony Bennett is the hair. A hightop fade that stops just short of the heavens themselves, it may be the single most majestic coiffure on display in the CWC. The second, and more pertinent thing, you’ll notice about him is that he’s really good. A product of “The World Famous Monster Factory” in South Jersey, Bennett boasts a growing resume to go with his look, including a defense of the promotion’s Supersonic Championship in its first Ladder Match earlier this year. In the CWC, he’ll have the chance to climb even higher, reaching rarified air that even his ’do can’t touch.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3111],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":44,"storytelling":54,"productFit":30,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":58,"psychology":44,"workerManagement":30,"trainingIntensity":67,"technicalCoaching":48,"characterCoaching":69,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":73,"mediaHandling":69,"brandBuilding":54,"socialMediaSavvy":38,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":6,"reactionSpeed":67,"consistency":66,"awareness":44,"judgement":38},"picture":"Anthony Bennett.png"},{"id":2292,"name":"Mustafa Ali","realName":"Mustafa Ali","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":28,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":182,"height":175,"dateOfBirth":"1986-03-28T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2003-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":41000,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":37,"charisma":77,"micSkills":96,"condition":87,"hardcoreAbility":93,"injuryProne":100,"ability":75,"currentAbility":75,"potentialAbility":79,"morale":"fair","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"For more than a decade, Ali pursued his dream of making it as a WWE Superstar, competing on the independent scene while working as a police officer in Chicago and starting a family. Barely squeaking his way into the 2016 Cruiserweight Classic after being announced as an alternate, Ali displayed a dogged perseverance that eventually took him all the way to a bout for the WWE Cruiserweight Championship against Cedric Alexander at WrestleMania. Although he was narrowly edged by his friend, Ali had the capacity crowd in the palm of his hand from bell to bell.\r\n\r\nAli moved from 205 Live to SmackDown LIVE and wasted no time turning heads, as he scored an incredible pinfall victory against then-WWE Champion Daniel Bryan in a tag team match. No stranger to thrilling moments inside the squared circle, Ali puts his extensive in-ring ability on full display when he executes the jaw-dropping 054, a reverse 450 splash on the blue brand. But it wasn't enough to prevent the inevitable chaos that was","alterEgos":["Prince Mustafa Ali"],"birthplace":"Bolingbrook, Illinois, United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2027-01-23T00:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2292","wrestlerId":2292,"promotionId":28,"startDate":"2025-01-23T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-01-23T00:00:00.000Z","wage":41000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2763],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":63,"storytelling":68,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":23,"matchLayout":69,"psychology":63,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":80,"technicalCoaching":57,"characterCoaching":72,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":77,"mediaHandling":72,"brandBuilding":64,"socialMediaSavvy":68,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":80,"consistency":79,"awareness":63,"judgement":78},"picture":"Mustafa Ali.png"},{"id":2293,"name":"Fabian Aichner","realName":"Adrian Severe","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":28,"base":"Europe","gender":"M","weight":220,"height":180,"dateOfBirth":"1990-07-21T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2011-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":41000,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":34,"charisma":72,"micSkills":89,"condition":89,"hardcoreAbility":87,"injuryProne":100,"ability":75,"currentAbility":75,"potentialAbility":81,"morale":"poor","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"powerhouse","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Intense. Fabian Aichner uses this word to describe himself, and it certainly fits. The elite competitor has come a long way since his humble beginnings in an Italian village of fewer than 2,000 people. Finding purpose in the squared circle, he made a name for himself in Europe thanks to his eye-popping combination of strength and speed. Only the second Italian-born Superstar ever in WWE — following legendary WWE Hall of Famer Bruno Sammartino — Aichner made his WWE debut in the historic Cruiserweight Classic. The chiseled workhouse turned heads with his high-flying arsenal and powerful stature, and that was before he showed up in NXT in September 2017 with even more muscle packed on to his sturdy frame. Now aligned with WALTER, Alexander Wolfe and Marcel Barthel in the dominant Imperium faction, this impressive Superstar has the force, velocity and confidence to dominate NXT UK and beyond.","alterEgos":["Adrian Severe","Giovanni Vinci"],"birthplace":"Pfalzen, Italy","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2028-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2293","wrestlerId":2293,"promotionId":28,"startDate":"2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2028-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":41000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1862,2151,2363],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":62,"storytelling":67,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":18,"matchLayout":68,"psychology":62,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":78,"technicalCoaching":68,"characterCoaching":49,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":82,"mediaHandling":49,"brandBuilding":66,"socialMediaSavvy":40,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":78,"consistency":80,"awareness":62,"judgement":77},"picture":"Fabian Aichner.png"},{"id":2294,"name":"Jason Lee","realName":"Jason Lee","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Other","gender":"M","weight":159,"height":165,"dateOfBirth":"1992-10-18T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":4166,"popularity":5,"charisma":64,"micSkills":55,"condition":92,"hardcoreAbility":43,"injuryProne":100,"ability":51,"currentAbility":50,"potentialAbility":57,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Jason Lee is a Hong Konger wrestler who works in the USA and Japan. He is a 5'6\", 159lb worker who is classed as using a Technician Flyer style. He uses the Sunset flip powerbomb as his finisher. He is best known for his work with Dragon Gate. He is the protege of Ho Ho Lun.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Unknown","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[4116],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":61,"storytelling":66,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":22,"matchLayout":67,"psychology":61,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":73,"technicalCoaching":58,"characterCoaching":51,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":78,"mediaHandling":51,"brandBuilding":48,"socialMediaSavvy":41,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":73,"consistency":67,"awareness":61,"judgement":77},"picture":"Jason Lee.png"},{"id":2295,"name":"Conor Claxton","realName":"Conor Claxton","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":216,"height":182,"dateOfBirth":"1993-06-28T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2014-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"