d":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Coming to the ring wearing a grotesque mask and wielding an axe, Vinny Marseglia is a horror movie villain come to life. Since being brought to Ring of Honor by Matt Taven in 2016 to form the new Kingdom along with TK O’Ryan, the heavily tattooed, aptly named “Horror King” has been terrorizing opponents with a dangerous combination of athleticism and sadism. Marseglia, who caught Taven’s eye while competing in the 2016 Top Prospect Tournament, wasted no time putting gold around his waist, as he, Taven and O’Ryan won a tournament to crown the inaugural ROH World Six-Man Tag Team Champions. \r\n\r\nIn addition to his frightening exploits in the ring, Marseglia was cast in the lead role of a psychopathic killer in the 2018 horror film “The Find.”","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2027-12-05T00:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2431","wrestlerId":2431,"promotionId":28,"startDate":"2025-12-05T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-12-05T00:00:00.000Z","wage":20500,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1973,3710,3824,4328,4329,4330],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":56,"storytelling":61,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":23,"matchLayout":63,"psychology":56,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":73,"technicalCoaching":39,"characterCoaching":69,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":77,"mediaHandling":69,"brandBuilding":55,"socialMediaSavvy":73,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":73,"consistency":71,"awareness":56,"judgement":74},"picture":"Vincent.png"},{"id":2432,"name":"TK O'Ryan","realName":"TK O'Ryan","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":205,"height":187,"dateOfBirth":"1989-10-03T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2012-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":375