 Luchador style.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Japan","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":65,"storytelling":68,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":28,"matchLayout":69,"psychology":65,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":58,"technicalCoaching":68,"characterCoaching":48,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":72,"mediaHandling":48,"brandBuilding":53,"socialMediaSavvy":31,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":58,"consistency":67,"awareness":65,"judgement":79},"picture":"Masamune.png"},{"id":2533,"name":"Maya Yukihi","realName":"Maya Yukihi","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Japan","gender":"F","weight":125,"height":162,"dateOfBirth":"1990-01-09T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2014-11-24T00:00:00.000Z","wage":4166,"popularity":8,"charisma":67,"micSkills":81,"condition":98,"hardcoreAbility":57,"injuryProne":100,"ability":74,"currentAbility":71,"potentialAbility":77,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Maya Yukihi, a 2014 graduate of the Ice Ribbon Dojo, is a Japanese wrestler who works in America and Japan. She is a Small worker who is classed as using a Technician Flyer style. She is one half of Azure Revolution alongside Risa Sera. She is best known for her work with Stardom, DDT, Ice Ribbon and OZ Academy.","alterEgos":["Maya Mamushi"],"birthplace":"Japan","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1702,1713,1717,2471],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":68,"storytelling":73,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":15,"matchLayout":74,"psychology":68,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":79,"technicalCoaching":73,"characterCoaching":73,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":85,"mediaHandling":73,"brandBuilding":79,"socialMediaSavvy":68,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":79,"consistency":69,"awareness":68,"judgement":81},"picture":"Maya Yukihi.png"},{"id":2534,"name":"Mascara Jr.","realName":"Mascara Jr.","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":206,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1973-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1992-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":3,"charisma":64,"micSkills":66,"condition":91,"hardcoreAbility":71,"injuryProne":93,"ability":56,"currentAbility":36,"potentialAbility":38,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Mascara Jr. is a masked Mexican luchador who works exclusively in Mexico. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Luchador style.","alterEgos":["Emo Extreme","Mascara Sagrada Jr."],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":58,"storytelling":68,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":71,"psychology":58,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":61,"technicalCoaching":62,"characterCoaching":53,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":73,"mediaHandling":53,"brandBuilding":73,"socialMediaSavvy":55,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":61,"consistency":84,"awareness":58,"judgement":75},"picture":"Mascara Jr.png"},{"id":2536,"name":"Damian Priest","realName":"Punishment Martinez","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":64,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":242,"height":195,"dateOfBirth":"1982-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2012-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":75000,"wageType":"monthly","popularity":57,"charisma":100,"micSkills":92,"condition":82,"hardcoreAbility":83,"injuryProne":100,"ability":68,"currentAbility":68,"potentialAbility":80,"morale":"good","presentation":"face","prestige":"mid","style":"striker","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"strike","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Damian Priest prowls NXT with one goal in mind: To carve a legacy so undeniable that his name will live forever.\r\n\r\nAs mysterious as he is imposing, the towering Superstar was introduced to the NXT Universe via a series of videos in 2019. The imagery gave clue to Priest’s active nightlife, as he was seen flanked by a harem as he hopped from one club to another in a stretch limousine. In stark contrast to the party atmosphere surrounding him, Priest maintained a stoic, if unsettling, presence.\r\n\r\nThat same eerie calmness is no less apparent when Priest takes to the ring. Armed with immense power and an extensive knowledge of martial arts, the New York slugger is an unbridled force to be reckoned with, but he exudes the quiet confidence of a man who knows he’s always in control of his situation, no matter the arena.","alterEgos":["Punishment Martinez"],"birthplace":"Bronx, New York City, United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2536","wrestlerId":2536,"promotionId":64,"startDate":"2018-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":75000,"wageType":"monthly","type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2741,2769],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":68,"storytelling":70,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":17,"matchLayout":70,"psychology":68,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":79,"technicalCoaching":51,"characterCoaching":70,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":83,"mediaHandling":70,"brandBuilding":79,"socialMediaSavvy":72,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":79,"consistency":78,"awareness":68,"judgement":81},"picture":"Damian Priest.png"},{"id":2540,"name":"Dave Bradshaw","realName":"Dave Bradshaw","nickname":"","type":"commentator","base":"UK","gender":"M","weight":210,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1979-01-11T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1997-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":66000,"popularity":0,"charisma":49,"micSkills":47,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":28,"injuryProne":60,"ability":46,"currentAbility":35,"potentialAbility":37,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Dave Bradshaw is an English man who works primarily as an announcer.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"England","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":0,"storytelling":0,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":100,"matchLayout":0,"psychology":0,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":0,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":61,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":0,"mediaHandling":61,"brandBuilding":10,"socialMediaSavvy":60,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":0,"reactionSpeed":0,"consistency":64,"awareness":0,"judgement":0},"picture":"Dave Bradshaw.png"},{"id":2541,"name":"Gabe Kidd","realName":"Gabe Kidd","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":38,"base":"UK","gender":"M","weight":236,"height":180,"dateOfBirth":"1997-04-24T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2013-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":40000,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":31,"charisma":54,"micSkills":57,"condition":85,"hardcoreAbility":58,"injuryProne":100,"ability":77,"currentAbility":77,"potentialAbility":96,"morale":"poor","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"striker","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"strike","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Gabe Kidd is an English wrestler who works in the USA, Canada, the British Isles and Japan. He is a 6'0\", 236lb worker who is classed as using a Brawler style. He uses the Sick Kick as his finisher. He is best known for his work with AEW, NJPW, NOAH, RevPro, NORTH and Defiant.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Nottingham, England","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2541","wrestlerId":2541,"promotionId":38,"startDate":"2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":40000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2848,3754,4034],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":71,"storytelling":73,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":24,"matchLayout":73,"psychology":71,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":82,"technicalCoaching":63,"characterCoaching":73,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":76,"mediaHandling":73,"brandBuilding":67,"socialMediaSavvy":65,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":82,"consistency":70,"awareness":71,"judgement":83},"picture":"Gabe Kidd.png","additionalContracts":[{"id":"tew-contract-2541-76","wrestlerId":2541,"promotionId":76,"startDate":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":40000,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false}],"alsoWorksFor":["AEW"]},{"id":2542,"name":"HT Drake","realName":"HT Drake","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"UK","gender":"M","weight":203,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1991-06-09T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":45,"micSkills":62,"condition":93,"hardcoreAbility":65,"injuryProne":100,"ability":61,"currentAbility":59,"potentialAbility":65,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"HT Drake, a 2009 graduate of the NGW Academy, is an English wrestler who works exclusively in the British Isles. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Regular style. He is best known for his work with NORTH.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"England","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":55,"storytelling":58,"productFit":71,"riskTaking":28,"matchLayout":59,"psychology":55,"workerManagement":71,"trainingIntensity":68,"technicalCoaching":58,"characterCoaching":34,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":72,"mediaHandling":34,"brandBuilding":37,"socialMediaSavvy":37,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":14,"reactionSpeed":68,"consistency":60,"awareness":55,"judgement":61},"picture":"HT Drake.png"},{"id":2544,"name":"James R. Kennedy","realName":"James R. Kennedy","nickname":"","type":"manager","base":"UK","gender":"M","weight":180,"height":180,"dateOfBirth":"1985-01-18T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2010-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":66000,"popularity":0,"charisma":39,"micSkills":51,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":22,"injuryProne":100,"ability":38,"currentAbility":33,"potentialAbility":36,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"From the ashes of the former 'Sports Agent To The Stars', has risen a very different James R. Kennedy. Once the figure-head of the Kennedy Administration, the eccentric manager looked to change ICW into his family-friendly vision of what it could become. However, after losing control over the talents in his employ, Kennedy's outlook changed dramatically, and he has now amassed the violent firm known simply as The 55. The mastermind behind this dangerous collective, Kennedy is now set on total dominance over the rest of the ICW roster, and he will stop at nothing until he sits atop the mountain in Insane Championship Wrestling. Darker, and more focused than ever before, James R. Kennedy's brilliant mind poses a very real threat to the stability of ICW, meaning everyone had best be on constant alert.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"England","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":36,"storytelling":31,"productFit":24,"riskTaking":51,"matchLayout":32,"psychology":35,"workerManagement":25,"trainingIntensity":39,"technicalCoaching":59,"characterCoaching":49,"teaching":31,"diagnosis":26,"rehabilitation":30,"prevention":24,"mediaHandling":60,"brandBuilding":89,"socialMediaSavvy":55,"ruleKnowledge":26,"positioning":48,"reactionSpeed":46,"consistency":48,"awareness":56,"judgement":34},"picture":"James R Kennedy.png"},{"id":2546,"name":"Prince Ameen","realName":"Prince Ameen","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"UK","gender":"M","weight":233,"height":185,"dateOfBirth":"1984-01-08T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2002-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":56,"micSkills":53,"condition":90,"hardcoreAbility":61,"injuryProne":100,"ability":57,"currentAbility":49,"potentialAbility":52,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"comedy","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"counter","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"You thought The Million Dollar Man was the richest man in wrestling? He’s practically a beggar next to Prince Ameen.Royalty from the ancient Indus Valley, Ameen is of impressive stock. He’s not showing his skills in the ring just to make a living; he already has enough to last him an eternity. Instead, he simply wants to prove to the world what India already knows: that’s he’s the very best.A noble upbringing doesn’t always result in a noble character, and though he claims to be the greatest grappler around, the Prince is never afraid to use some underhand tactics to get ahead. Sometimes there’s more in that turban than just his head…","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"England","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":60,"storytelling":62,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":34,"matchLayout":62,"psychology":60,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":72,"technicalCoaching":40,"characterCoaching":47,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":66,"mediaHandling":47,"brandBuilding":55,"socialMediaSavvy":47,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":72,"consistency":70,"awareness":60,"judgement":76},"picture":"Prince Ameen.png"},{"id":2549,"name":"Ortiz","realName":"Ortiz","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":49,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":191,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1991-09-27T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":32800,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":29,"charisma":60,"micSkills":51,"condition":91,"hardcoreAbility":46,"injuryProne":100,"ability":65,"currentAbility":65,"potentialAbility":81,"morale":"poor","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":true,"story":"Ortiz is an American wrestler who works exclusively in North America. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Regular style. He is one half of Proud-N-Po