. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Regular style. He is one half of The REP alongside Nate Carter. He is best known for his work with Beyond and CZW.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1677,1678,2129],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":47,"storytelling":52,"productFit":54,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":54,"psychology":47,"workerManagement":54,"trainingIntensity":72,"technicalCoaching":55,"characterCoaching":48,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":73,"mediaHandling":48,"brandBuilding":42,"socialMediaSavvy":38,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":11,"reactionSpeed":72,"consistency":66,"awareness":47,"judgement":50},"picture":"Dave McCall.png"},{"id":2812,"name":"Nate Carter","realName":"Nate Carter","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":198,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1989-01-19T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2011-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":47,"micSkills":38,"condition":96,"hardcoreAbility":42,"injuryProne":100,"ability":49,"currentAbility":46,"potentialAbility":51,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Nate Carter is an American wrestler who works exclusively in America. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Regular style. He is one half of Dub Boys alongside Dave McCall. He is best known for his work with CZW. He is currently a CZW Tag Team champion.","alterEgos":["Nate Wallace"],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1677,1678,2129],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":46,"storytelling":53,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":22,"matchLayout":55,"ps