he most unique offensive approaches in all of WWE, excitement is in store every time Kayden Carter competes.\r\n\r\nA member of the 2012 NCAA Division II championship basketball team at Shaw University — where she also graduated magna cum laude — Carter next tried her hand at sports-entertainment. She learned to mix it up in the ring from two of the best brawlers around: WWE Hall of Famers The Dudley Boyz.\r\n\r\nCarter landed at the WWE Performance Center — just down the road from where she grew up in Winter Park, Fla. — and competed in the 2018 Mae Young Classic. Not satisfied with merely taking part, she picked up two victories to advance to the quarterfinals and turned heads with her unique blending of in-ring styles.","alterEgos":["Kayden Carter"],"birthplace":"Winter Park, Florida, United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2027-09-11T00:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2871","wrestlerId":2871,"promotionId":49,"startDate":"2025-09-11T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-09-11T00:00:00.000Z","wage":24600,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[2344,3727],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":47,"storytelling":51,"productFit":52,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":52,"psychology":47,"workerManagement":52,"trainingIntensity":67,"technicalCoaching":40,"characterCoaching":64,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":73,"mediaHandling":64,"brandBuilding":68,"socialMediaSavvy":45,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":10,"reactionSpeed":67,"consistency":58,"awareness":47,"judgement":49},"picture":"Lacey Lane_alt4.png"},{"id":2872,"name":"Ultimo Ant","realName":"Ultimo Ant","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":185,"height":177,"dateOfBirth":"1996-06-30T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2018-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":35,"micSkills":48,"co