name":"Axiom","realName":"A-Kid","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":64,"base":"Europe","gender":"M","weight":154,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1997-05-09T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2012-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":50000,"wageType":"monthly","popularity":30,"charisma":70,"micSkills":84,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":61,"injuryProne":100,"ability":79,"currentAbility":79,"potentialAbility":88,"morale":"poor","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Since emerging on the NXT UK scene, Spanish Superstar A-Kid has quickly captured the interest of the WWE Universe as well as prominent competitors like the first-ever United Kingdom Champion, Tyler Bate. Win or lose, the up-and-comer has wasted little time bringing the fight to a number of high-profile opponents that include Kassius Ohno, Jordan Devlin and Bate himself.\r\n\r\nHailing from one of the hardest-working neighborhoods of Madrid, A-Kid takes pride in representing his homeland as WWE’s first Spanish Superstar. A versatile competitor who can dish out strikes, masterfully applied holds, and high-risk maneuvers alike, the versatile Superstar is a student of the squared circle with all the tools needed for greatness.\r\n\r\nThough A-Kid has already achieved what he says were life-long dreams by reaching WWE, he promises that it’s only the beginning. And if he has his way, he’s out to prove that A-Kid from Spain can be as good as any wrestler in the world.","alterEgos":["A-Kid"],"birthplace":"Madrid, Spain","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2027-04-25T00:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2955","wrestlerId":2955,"promotionId":64,"startDate":"2025-04-25T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-04-25T00:00:00.000Z","wage":50000,"wageType":"monthly","type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"record":{"win