rrentAbility":34,"potentialAbility":42,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Southern promoter Colonel Robert Parker’s debutante, Aria Blake serves as the manager for Parker’s Stud Stable.\r\n\r\nOften labeled a social climber… even a gold digger, one cannot deny Blake’s success, having managed tag teams to championship gold in the past, including Richard Holliday & MJF. Nowadays, Blake can be found cracking the whip as the Stud Stable’s very hands on manger or cuddling with the Colonel.\r\n\r\nOften referring to Parker as “big daddy,” Aria has been called a swindler as well as a vicious, cunning and conniving schemer by many. Others have gone as far as to label her a “grifter” of sorts, however, Aria Blake insists she is simply an ambitious southern socialite. With new power and Parker’s cash to bankroll her agenda, Aria is more obnoxious and vindictive than ever before.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1760],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":39,"storytelling":45,"productFit":16,"riskTaking":33,"matchLayout":47,"psychology":39,"workerManagement":16,"trainingIntensity":67,"technicalCoaching":40,"characterCoaching":57,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":67,"mediaHandling":57,"brandBuilding":44,"socialMediaSavvy":47,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":3,"reactionSpeed":67,"consistency":56,"awareness":39,"judgement":30},"picture":"Aria Blake.png"},{"id":2980,"name":"Salina de la Renta","realName":"Salina de la Renta","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":68,"base":"USA","gender":"F","weight":141,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1997-02-06T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2016-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":13100,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":9,"charisma":33,"micSkills":42,"condition":98,"hardcoreAbility":31,"injuryProne":100,"ability":43,"currentAbility":43,"potentialAbility":52,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Salina de La Renta is the founder of Promociones Dorado, which acts as a pipeline to the stars of Latin America for sports leagues, TV and film in the United States and abroad. A powerful player in sports and entertainment in Latin America, Salina de la Renta is one of today’s most sophisticated and driven entrepreneurs. A modern impresaria, Salina de la Renta is connected with the biggest television networks, entertainers and athletes of Latin America. So, when MLW wanted to showcase lucha libre, they issued a promoting and managing license to Salina de la Renta. Simply put? If you want best of the best from Latin America, you go to Salina de la Renta who represents the best in Lucha Libre. While her main office is based out of Dorado, Puerto Rico, de la Renta has satellite offices in Mexico City, Bolivia, Chile and San Diego, California.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Puerto Rico","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2980","wrestlerId":2980,"promotionId":68,"startDate":"2023-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":13100,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[1760],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":36,"storytelling":41,"productFit":10,"riskTaking":39,"matchLayout":42,"psychology":36,"workerManagement":10,"trainingIntensity":60,"technicalCoaching":35,"characterCoaching":74,"teaching":20,"diagno