ther of wrestler Bandido and cousin of Magia Blanca. His real name is not a matter of public record as is often the case with masked wrestlers in Mexico. In 2012, Angelikal made his debut on the independent circuit teaming with Crossfire and Stukita. In December 2018, La Parka gave Angelikal a new mask, thus changing his name to Myzteziz Jr.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":48,"storytelling":55,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":58,"psychology":48,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":78,"technicalCoaching":57,"characterCoaching":56,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":73,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":67,"socialMediaSavvy":29,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":78,"consistency":57,"awareness":48,"judgement":69},"picture":"Myzteziz.png"},{"id":3045,"name":"Nyla Rose","realName":"Nyla Rose","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":49,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":169,"height":172,"dateOfBirth":"1982-08-03T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2012-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":24600,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":26,"charisma":61,"micSkills":66,"condition":66,"hardcoreAbility":83,"injuryProne":100,"ability":52,"currentAbility":52,"potentialAbility":64,"morale":"poor","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"powerhouse","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":true,"story":"\"The Native Beast\" Nyla Rose is an American wrestler. She is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Brawler style. Having trained at KYDApro Wrestling school under trainers such as John Kerman, C.A. Elliott, Christian York and Xander maddoX, Nyla Rose uses her vast Martial arts knowledge coupled with an aggressive, In your face style, to shock and Awe audiences. Be warned, this woman isn't afraid to take to the sky every now and again!","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Washington, D.C., United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-3045","wrestlerId":3045,"promotionId":49,"startDate":"2023-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":24600,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3565],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":57,"storytelling":61,"productFit":74,"riskTaking":46,"matchLayout":63,"psychology":57,"workerManagement":74,"trainingIntensity":66,"technicalCoaching":37,"characterCoaching":62,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":54,"mediaHandling":62,"brandBuilding":58,"socialMediaSavvy":50,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":15,"reactionSpeed":66,"consistency":71,"awareness":57,"judgement":64},"picture":"Nyla Rose_alt3.png"},{"id":3046,"name":"Royce Isaacs","realName":"Royce Isaacs","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":242,"height":182,"dateOfBirth":"1989-02-08T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2016-04-10T00:00:00.000Z","wage":4166,"popularity":5,"charisma":51,"micSkills":66,"condition":97,"hardcoreAbility":46,"injuryProne":100,"ability":63,"currentAbility":59,"potentialAbility":64,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"upper","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Royce Isaacs is an American wrestler who works in the USA and Japan. He is a 6'1\", 242lb worker who is classed as using a Regular style. He uses the Hush Money as his finisher. He is one half of World Class Wrecking Crew alongside Jorel Nelson. He is best known for his work with NJPW, CMLL, DDT, PWG, NWA