e belt, however, the promotion folded. Shortly after Stevens was involved in rivalries with both Sedrick Strong and Vordell Walker. On March 31, 2007 Stevens made his debut for Ring of Honor (ROH) in Detroit, Michigan at All Star Extravaganza III. ROH stopped using Stevens in the Fall of 2010 and he retired from professional wrestling soon after. He returned to the ring in 2019 after 9 years out of the business.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":67,"storytelling":70,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":17,"matchLayout":71,"psychology":67,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":75,"technicalCoaching":64,"characterCoaching":52,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":83,"mediaHandling":52,"brandBuilding":45,"socialMediaSavvy":38,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":75,"consistency":75,"awareness":67,"judgement":80},"picture":"Erick Stevens_alt1.png"},{"id":3205,"name":"Super Beetle","realName":"Super Beetle","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":176,"height":162,"dateOfBirth":"1995-02-22T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2016-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":57,"micSkills":63,"condition":97,"hardcoreAbility":60,"injuryProne":100,"ability":51,"currentAbility":51,"potentialAbility":51,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":true,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Super Beetle is a retired American wrestler who tends to stay behind the scenes in the wrestling world. He was one half of Hard Knocks And Bug Bites alongside Ty Ray. He is best known for his work with CWFH.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"