t who is classed as using a Regular Wrestler style. He is best known for his work on the independent circuit. Among his achievements, is his one-and-a-half year undefeated All Pro Wrestling Tag Team Championship reign in addition to a tag team victory over the infamous New Age Outlaws. He was a contestant in the 2011 WWE Tough Enough season contest and a participant in the TNA GutCheck Challenge. He found his passion in high school as a two-year varsity wrestler in Mill Valley, California. A.J. remained committed to his education, receiving a BA in Communication Studies from California State University, Chico. A.J. currently resides in Sacramento, California.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":49,"storytelling":56,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":22,"matchLayout":59,"psychology":49,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":78,"technicalCoaching":53,"characterCoaching":47,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":78,"mediaHandling":47,"brandBuilding":34,"socialMediaSavvy":53,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":78,"consistency":66,"awareness":49,"judgement":69},"picture":"AJ Kirsch.png"},{"id":3281,"name":"Naomi Yoshimura","realName":"Naomi Yoshimura","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Japan","gender":"M","weight":276,"height":177,"dateOfBirth":"1995-04-21T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2016-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":4166,"popularity":5,"charisma":47,"micSkills":63,"condition":83,"hardcoreAbility":44,"injuryProne":100,"ability":65,"currentAbility":65,"potentialAbility":73,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"submission","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Naomi Yoshimura is a Japanese wrestler who works exclus