He is one half of Above The Rest alongside Gabriel Skye. He is best known for his work with MLW, Beyond and CZW.","alterEgos":["Tristen Thai"],"birthplace":"South Korea","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-3294","wrestlerId":3294,"promotionId":68,"startDate":"2024-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":13100,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3410,3411,3412],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":48,"storytelling":52,"productFit":28,"riskTaking":42,"matchLayout":53,"psychology":48,"workerManagement":28,"trainingIntensity":73,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":54,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":58,"mediaHandling":54,"brandBuilding":45,"socialMediaSavvy":52,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":6,"reactionSpeed":73,"consistency":70,"awareness":48,"judgement":40},"picture":"Ikuro Kwon.png"},{"id":3295,"name":"King Mo","realName":"King Mo","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":205,"height":180,"dateOfBirth":"1981-01-11T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2012-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":6,"charisma":45,"micSkills":44,"condition":83,"hardcoreAbility":29,"injuryProne":100,"ability":49,"currentAbility":40,"potentialAbility":42,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"submission","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"A former Strikeforce Light Heavyweight Champion and Rizin Heavyweight Grand Prix Champion, the 6' tall 217 pound fighter is a member of the prestigious American Top Team (“ATT”) under the guidance of Dan Lambert. No stranger to the sport of pro wrestling, King Mo is a lifelong fan making his pro wrestling debut in 2012. While flamboyant and outspoken, King Mo is to many the truest fighter of all. With 21 wins in MMA (13 by KO), the former NCAA Division 1 All American for Oklahoma State and Bellator fighter has exceptional qualifications and a record along with MMA championships to back it up. A world class athlete, Mo looks to make Major League Wrestling his kingdom for fighting.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":42,"storytelling":46,"productFit":5,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":47,"psychology":42,"workerManagement":5,"trainingIntensity":80,"technicalCoaching":44,"characterCoaching":64,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":63,"mediaHandling":64,"brandBuilding":76,"socialMediaSavvy":45,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":1,"reactionSpeed":80,"consistency":57,"awareness":42,"judgement":27},"picture":"King Mo.png"},{"id":3296,"name":"Gino Medina","realName":"Gino Medina","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Mexico","gender":"M","weight":220,"height":185,"dateOfBirth":"1996-01-04T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2015-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":3,"charisma":42,"micSkills":56,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":43,"injuryProne":90,"ability":45,"currentAbility":45,"potentialAbility":54,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Employing a variety of ranas and finesse in his matches, Gino oozes confidence. Despite being in his young 20s, Gino is a veteran of the ring having made his debut at the tender age of 6 as a mini in a match.\r\n\r\nLucha is not only in his blood but has been the family business for decades. Gino’s father, the late El Sanguinario, was a renowned luchador and member of the iconic Gringos Locos faction alongside Konnan and Eddie Guerrero among others.\r\n\r\nBorn into Mexican nobility, the chic luchador believes he is the essence of greatness and it’s hard to argue with the results when he gets in the ring.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":48,"storytelling":54,"productFit":24,"riskTaking":38,"matchLayout":56,"psychology":48,"workerManagement":24,"trainingIntensity":67,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":45,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":62,"mediaHandling":45,"brandBuilding":50,"socialMediaSavvy":27,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":5,"reactionSpeed":67,"consistency":69,"awareness":48,"judgement":38},"picture":"Gino Medina.png"},{"id":3298,"name":"Lou King Sharp","realName":"Lou King Sharp","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"UK","gender":"M","weight":119,"height":160,"dateOfBirth":"1995-01-10T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2013-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":69,"micSkills":59,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":48,"injuryProne":100,"ability":60,"currentAbility":60,"potentialAbility":68,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Lou King Sharp is a Scottish wrestler who works in the British Isles and Europe. He is a Small worker who is classed as using a Cruiserweight style. The cocky self proclaimed sexiest man in professional wrestling and your mothers favourite wrestler Lou King Sharp (say it fast) made his debut in November 2013 for Premier British Wrestling against Kenny Williams and since has had the pleasure of working for promotions up and down the UK. Quick and ruthless tactics interspersed with panic and petulance when things don't go his way.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Scotland","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3226,3592],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":43,"storytelling":53,"productFit":20,"riskTaking":34,"matchLayout":57,"psychology":43,"workerManagement":20,"trainingIntensity":71,"technicalCoaching":58,"characterCoaching":58,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":66,"mediaHandling":58,"brandBuilding":49,"socialMediaSavvy":53,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":4,"reactionSpeed":71,"consistency":73,"awareness":43,"judgement":34},"picture":"Lou King Sharp.png"},{"id":3299,"name":"Krieger","realName":"Krieger","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"UK","gender":"M","weight":207,"height":185,"dateOfBirth":"1993-01-17T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2014-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":1,"charisma":68,"micSkills":64,"condition":95,"hardcoreAbility":66,"injuryProne":100,"ability":50,"currentAbility":49,"potentialAbility":56,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Krieger is a Scottish wrestler who works exclusively in the British Isles. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Technician style. Kreiger believes himself to be the best mover in Scottish wrestling, but despite his self-styled confidence, the fans think very differently! Indeed, Kreiger's delusions have not won him many fans as this Glasgow grappler looks to stir-up a storm.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Scotland","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3226,3592],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":53,"storytelling":58,"productFit":20,"riskTaking":22,"matchLayout":60,"