ll-groomed, eloquent and looked more like an ad exec trapped in the middle of a barroom brawl.\r\n\r\nBut the disparity between the competitors throwing chair shots in the ring and the man calling the shots in the announce booth was exactly why it worked so well. While Terry Funk and Sabu tore each other apart in a brutal Barbwire Match, Styles brought a humanity to the ensuing carnage. Think of it this way — Styles was the calm in the middle of a storm. That was until there was a truly unbelievable moment in the match, in which case The Extreme Announcer would unleash the three simple words that became his signature phrase: “Oh my God!\"","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":0,"storytelling":0,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":100,"matchLayout":0,"psychology":0,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":0,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":53,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":0,"mediaHandling":53,"brandBuilding":10,"socialMediaSavvy":43,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":0,"reactionSpeed":0,"consistency":0,"awareness":0,"judgement":0},"picture":"Joey Styles.png"},{"id":3863,"name":"Brodie Lee Jr.","realName":"Brodie Lee Jr.","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":118,"height":167,"dateOfBirth":"2012-01-17T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2026-04-10T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":8,"charisma":23,"micSkills":28,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":34,"injuryProne":100,"ability":42,"currentAbility":29,"potentialAbility":87,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Brodie Lee Jr. is the son of deceased wrestler Jon Huber, famously known as Brodie Lee or Luke Harper. During his father's illness, he was signed to an official contract at AEW, the company Huber was working for at the time of his passing, and has since become an on-screen character including doing color commentary on AEW Dark.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":34,"storytelling":42,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":45,"psychology":34,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":65,"technicalCoaching":31,"characterCoaching":55,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":63,"mediaHandling":55,"brandBuilding":44,"socialMediaSavvy":51,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":0,"reactionSpeed":65,"consistency":48,"awareness":34,"judgement":20},"picture":"Brodie Lee Jr.png"},{"id":3864,"name":"Dan Severn","realName":"Dan Severn","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":253,"height":185,"dateOfBirth":"1958-06-09T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1991-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":23,"charisma":44,"micSkills":40,"condition":55,"hardcoreAbility":70,"injuryProne":100,"ability":51,"currentAbility":23,"potentialAbility":25,"morale":"poor","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"submission","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Dan Severn is an American wrestler who works in America, Canada and Japan. He is a Light Heavyweight who is classed as using a MMA Crossover style. In amateur wrestling, Severn was a two time All-American at Arizona State University and a U.S. Olympic Team alternate. In 1994, Severn started competing in the Ultimate Fighting Championships. He was the first world-class wrestler to enter the UFC, foreshadowing the period of dominance by wrestlers such as Don Frye in UFC 8 and 9 and Mark Coleman in UFC 10 and 11.  As Severn is accomplished in amateur wrestling, is also an accomplished professional wrestler too, having worked for UWF International in Japan, the National Wrestling Alliance (NWA), and the World Wrestling Federation (WWF).","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":69,"storytelling":68,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":21,"matchLayout":67,"psychology":69,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":62,"technicalCoaching":54,"characterCoaching":50,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":79,"mediaHandling":50,"brandBuilding":30,"socialMediaSavvy":42,"ruleKnowledge":2,"positioning":22,"reactionSpeed":62,"consistency":82,"awareness":69,"judgement":81},"picture":"Dan Severn.png"},{"id":3865,"name":"Lady C","realName":"Lady C","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":61,"base":"Japan","gender":"F","weight":148,"height":175,"dateOfBirth":"1994-11-17T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2020-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":30700,"wageType":"monthly","popularity":12,"charisma":59,"micSkills":43,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":26,"injuryProne":100,"ability":35,"currentAbility":35,"potentialAbility":43,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"powerhouse","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Lady C is a Japanese wrestler who works exclusively in Japan. She is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Powerhouse style. She is best known for her work with Stardom.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Japan","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-3865","wrestlerId":3865,"promotionId":61,"startDate":"2020-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":30700,"wageType":"monthly","type