lsea Durden is an American wrestler who works exclusively in America. She is a Small worker who is classed as using a Regular style. She is best known for her work with SHINE. She is married to someone outside the wrestling business.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3493],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":40,"storytelling":42,"productFit":15,"riskTaking":35,"matchLayout":43,"psychology":40,"workerManagement":15,"trainingIntensity":63,"technicalCoaching":12,"characterCoaching":55,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":65,"mediaHandling":55,"brandBuilding":44,"socialMediaSavvy":58,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":3,"reactionSpeed":63,"consistency":50,"awareness":40,"judgement":30},"picture":"Chelsea Durden.png"},{"id":4295,"name":"Kelsey Raegan","realName":"Kelsey Raegan","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"USA","gender":"F","weight":114,"height":165,"dateOfBirth":"1990-10-06T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2019-11-17T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1500,"popularity":1,"charisma":42,"micSkills":43,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":46,"injuryProne":100,"ability":37,"currentAbility":35,"potentialAbility":41,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"technical","cardPosition":"mid","finisher":"","finisherType":"submission","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Kelsey Raegan, who graduated from D-Von Dudley Academy on 01 November 2019, is an American wrestler who works exclusively in the USA. She is a 5'6\", 114lb worker who is classed as using a Regular style. She has regular tag teams with Chelsea Durden (The Prophecy) and Devlyn Macabre (Venom and Violence). She is best known for her work with SHINE. She is dating someone outside the wrestling business. She is the protege of Gangrel.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[3493,3877],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":39,"storytelling":44,"productFit":37,"riskTaking":32,"matchLayout":45,"psychology":39,"workerManagement":37,"trainingIntensity":54,"technicalCoaching":32,"characterCoaching":58,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":68,"mediaHandling":58,"brandBuilding":57,"socialMediaSavvy":48,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":7,"reactionSpeed":54,"consistency":47,"awareness":39,"judgement":38},"picture":"Kelsey Raegan.png"},{"id":4296,"name":"Charles Mason","realName":"Charles Mason","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","promotionId":77,"base":"USA","gender":"M","weight":200,"height":170,"dateOfBirth":"1993-05-29T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2017-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":13100,"wageType":"per-appearance","popularity":4,"charisma":37,"micSkills":49,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":40,"injuryProne":100,"ability":50,"currentAbility":49,"potentialAbility":56,"morale":"broken","presentation":"heel","prestige":"low","style":"powerhouse","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"They say money is the root of all evil, and that has never rung more true with someone quite like Charles Mason. A product of the House of Glory school, Charles was not always as you see him today. In fact, he begun his career as a long-haired, fun-loving kid from Hewlett Bay Park, New York. Interacting with the poor scum of New York took it's toll on Charles mentally and made him reconsider the path he was on. Unsatisfied, Mason amassed a life of wealth to seperate himself from the common man. Now making his summer residence in Palm Springs, California and living life like a king, Charles surrounds himself with people attending to his every need for life's more trivial things such as cooking and picking up his dry cleaning. If you just so happen to be poor, or an attractive young woman, it would be wise to stay far, far, away from Charles....","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","contract":{"id":"tew-contract-4296","wrestlerId":4296,"promotionId":77,"startDate":"2021-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":13100,"wageType":"per-appearance","type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","bookingsPerMonth":4,"autoRenew":false},"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":43,"storytelling":49,"productFit":25,"riskTaking":38,"matchLayout":51,"psychology":43,"workerManagement":25,"trainingIntensity":72,"technicalCoaching":39,"characterCoaching":63,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":62,"mediaHandling":63,"brandBuilding":47,"socialMediaSavvy":67,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":5,"reactionSpeed":72,"consistency":66,"awareness":43,"judgement":36},"picture":"Charles Mason.png"},{"id":4297,"name":"Juria Nagano","realName":"Juria Nagano","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Japan","gender":"F","weight":123,"height":157,"dateOfBirth":"1996-02-10T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2022-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":3,"charisma":30,"micSkills":47,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":29,"injuryProne":100,"ability":48,"currentAbility":48,"potentialAbility":48,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"striker","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"strike","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Juria Nagano is a retired Japanese wrestler who tends to stay behind the scenes in the wrestling world. She is best known for her work with TJPW. Outside of wrestling she is a regular TV actor.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Japan","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":43,"storytelling":46,"productFit":2,"riskTaking":31,"matchLayout":47,"psychology":43,"workerManagement":2,"trainingIntensity":64,"technicalCoaching":23,"characterCoaching":54,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":69,"mediaHandling":54,"brandBuilding":75,"socialMediaSavvy":64,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":0,"reactionSpeed":64,"consistency":60,"awareness":43,"judgement":27},"picture":"Juria Nagano.png"},{"id":4298,"name":"Fujita Hayato","realName":"Fujita Hayato","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Japan","gender":"M","weight":172,"height":172,"dateOfBirth":"1986-09-20T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2004-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":8,"charisma":59,"micSkills":72,"condition":74,"hardcoreAbility":78,"injuryProne":100,"ability":64,"currentAbility":57,"potentialAbility":61,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Fujita Hayato was trained for professional wrestling by Michinoku Pro Wrestling president Jinsei Shinzaki. Shinzaki discovered Hayato whilst attending a Greco Roman Wrestling tournament in Tokyo that Hayato was competing in. Hayato accepted an invitation to join Michinoku Pro and began training. Prior to his pro debut, Hayato also trained under mixed martial artist Norifumi \"KID\" Yamamoto, and as a tribute to his trainer he dubbed his finishing hold, the guillotine choke, the \"K.I.D.\" Fujita made his pro debut in the main event of Michinoku Pro's December 3, 2004 event in Tokyo's Korakuen Hall. He lost to Katsuhiko Nakajima via a crab hold. Hayato announced in late November 2018 that he had cancer and left the business until May 2022, when he returned at Michinoku Pro Wrestling.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Japan","