evision shows. He never strayed from his home building though and ended up winning a lot of big matches such as the hairs of Pirata Morgan and El Dandy and the mask of Mosco de la Merced. Antifaz also competed on the WWF's short-lived \"Super Astros\" show where he agreed to wrestle unmasked as Manuel Gomez. Somehow this also led to him working a few shows for ECW opposite both Tajiri and Super Crazy.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":69,"storytelling":71,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":32,"matchLayout":72,"psychology":69,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":63,"technicalCoaching":55,"characterCoaching":42,"teaching":20,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":68,"mediaHandling":42,"brandBuilding":52,"socialMediaSavvy":31,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":63,"consistency":56,"awareness":69,"judgement":81},"picture":"Antifaz Del Norte.png"},{"id":4401,"name":"Reina Dorada","realName":"Reina Dorada","nickname":"","type":"wrestler","base":"Mexico","gender":"F","weight":117,"height":154,"dateOfBirth":"1995-01-09T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2013-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":37500,"popularity":2,"charisma":49,"micSkills":48,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":36,"injuryProne":100,"ability":51,"currentAbility":51,"potentialAbility":59,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"high flyer","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"aerial","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Reina Dorada is a masked Mexican luchadora who works exclusively in Mexico. She is a Very Small worker who is classed as using a Luchador style. She is best known for her work with AAA.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"Mexico","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[