erformance artist who became known in wrestling circles in 2021 after several performances and appearances on NXT. Idolizing The Undertaker and Mankind as a child, she aspired to work for WWE for a long time and was quick to say yes when approached to perform on the NXT brand by Triple H. Her unique, alien personality makes her ideally suited for the wrestling business and it seems likely she would jump at the chance to make a return.","alterEgos":[],"birthplace":"United States","managerId":0,"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"teams":[],"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":15,"storytelling":19,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":50,"matchLayout":20,"psychology":15,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":40,"technicalCoaching":10,"characterCoaching":83,"teaching":40,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":50,"mediaHandling":83,"brandBuilding":83,"socialMediaSavvy":68,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":0,"reactionSpeed":40,"consistency":25,"awareness":15,"judgement":9},"picture":"Poppy.png"},{"id":4463,"name":"Nita Strauss","realName":"Nita Strauss","nickname":"","type":"manager","base":"USA","gender":"F","weight":132,"height":167,"dateOfBirth":"1986-12-07T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2018-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":66000,"popularity":19,"charisma":54,"micSkills":41,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":58,"injuryProne":0,"ability":43,"currentAbility":38,"potentialAbility":42,"morale":"broken","presentation":"face","prestige":"low","style":"all rounder","cardPosition":"lower","finisher":"","finisherType":"power","character":"","acceptsIndieBookings":false,"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"inDevelopment":false,"story":"Nita Strauss is one of the most female guitarists in the world and a big wrestling fan who was introduced to WWE by her boyfriend. She initially only watched because it was important to him, but quickly became a fan herself. She performed in WWE for the first time at Wrestlemania 34, playing Shinsuke Na